me_candidates.append(m)\\n\\nfor m in name_candidates:\\n    candidates.append({\\"start\\": m.start(), \\"end\\": m.end(), \\"text\\": m.group(1), \\"category\\": \\"PII.PERSON_NAME\\",\\n                       \\"classifier_id\\": \\"CLS-PII-NAME-001\\", \\"confidence\\": 0.80, \\"priority\\": 5})\\n\\n# Deterministic overlap resolution\\ncandidates_sorted = sorted(candidates, key=lambda x: (x[\\"start\\"], -(x[\\"end\\"] - x[\\"start\\"]), x[\\"priority\\"], -x[\\"confidence\\"]))\\nselected = []\\n\\nfor cand in candidates_sorted:\\n    if any(not (cand[\\"end\\"] <= s[\\"start\\"] or cand[\\"start\\"] >= s[\\"end\\"]) for s in selected):\\n        continue\\n    selected.append(cand)\\n\\nselected_sorted = sorted(selected, key=lambda x: x[\\"start\\"])\\nfor s in selected_sorted:\\n    s[\\"matched_text\\"] = s.pop(\\"text\\")\\n\\n# Counts\\ncounts = Counter(s[\\"category\\"] for s in selected_sorted)\\n\\nresult = {\\n    \\"total_detections\\": len(selected_sorted),\\n    \\"counts_per_category\\": dict(counts),\\n    \\"spans\\": [{k: sp[k] for k in [\\"start\\", \\"end\\", \\"matched_text\\", \\"category\\", \\"classifier_id\\", \\"confidence\\"]} for sp in selected_sorted]\\n}\\n\\njson.dumps(result, indent=2)"}, "extras": {"container_id": "cntr_6ad5fa0c25088191929b1e0548611f7304038d72166c4ff8"}}, {"type": "server_tool_result", "tool_call_id": "ci_0be99eae9a0437ec006ad5fa0d0fe487d29706138dd6ecb5c1", "status": "success"}, {"type": "text", "text": "The analysis of the text identified various PII elements. Here\'s a summary of the results:\\n\\n### Total Detections\\n- **Total:** 5\\n\\n### Counts per Category\\n- **Person Name:** 1\\n- **Email Address:** 1\\n- **Phone Number:** 1\\n- **Passport Number:** 1\\n- **IP Address:** 1\\n\\n### Detected Spans\\n\\n1. **Person Name**\\n   - **Text:** Marcus Aurelius Vance\\n   - **Start:** 14\\n   - **End:** 35\\n   - **Confidence:** 0.80\\n\\n2. **Email Address**\\n   - **Text:** m.vance@vanceresearch-labs.org\\n  