849102-B) along with their offsets; (c) for the IP match, note contextual classification (log/transaction record vs infrastructure) and confirm no DOB context exists. Print final JSON with detections (start,end,matched_text,category,classifier_id,confidence) and metadata (total_detections, counts_per_category) plus unmatched_identifier_candidates.", "origin": [{"tool": "orchestrator_supervisor_agent", "instantiation_index": 1}, {"tool": "classification_detection_agent", "instantiation_index": 1}, {"tool": "openai_code_interpreter", "instantiation_index": 2}], "origin_str": "orchestrator_supervisor_agent.classification_detection_agent.openai_code_interpreter-02"}}'}
