2026-10-19 12:18:29 BST | INFO     | NeuroSan:_log:821 - NeuroSan - {"message": "Result from OpenAI Tool: [{'type': 'server_tool_call', 'name': 'code_interpreter', 'id': 'ci_02f1d29b674443e5006ad5fc70f01c87d29121f232d3e148d2', 'args': {'code': 'import re\nimport json\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\n# Define the document\nDOC = """1. Full Name: Marcus Aurelius Vance\n2. System Username: mavance_admin\n3. Email Address: m.vance@gmail.com\n4. Primary Phone: +1 (555) 712-4091\n5. User Role: Senior Systems Administrator\n6. Passport Number: N89201492\n7. Last Login IP: 192.168.10.45\n8. Residential Address: 100 Cyberdyne Way, Suite 400, Portland, OR 97201\n9. Social Security Number: 483-92-1049\n10. Health Insurance Number: HI-902849102-B"""\n\n# Define the patterns\npatterns = [\n    (r"\\b\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{4}\\b", "PII.IDENTIFIER.SSN", "CLS-PII-SSN-001", 0.95),\n    (r"\\b[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}\\b", "PII.CONTACT.EMAIL", "CLS-PII-EMAIL-001", 0.95),\n    (r"(?:\\+?1[-. ]?)?(?:\\(\\d{3}\\)|\\b\\d{3})[-. ]?\\d{3}[-. ]?\\d{4}\\b", "PII.CONTACT.PHONE_NUMBER", "CLS-PII-PHONE-001", 0.90),\n    (r"\\b(?:(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\.){3}(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\b", "PII.LOCATION.IP_ADDRESS", "CLS-PII-IP-001", 0.90),\n    (r"\\b[A-Z]\\d{8,9}\\b", "PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT", "CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001", 0.85),\n    (r"\\b\\d{1,5}\\s+[A-Za-z0-9\\s.,]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:[A-Za-z0-9\\s.,#]+)?(?:,\\s+[A-Za-z\\s]+,\\s+[A-Z]{2}\\s+\\d{5}(?:-\\d{4})?)?\\b", "PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS", "CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001", 0.85),\n    (r"\\b[A-Z][a-z]+(?:\\s+[A-Z][a-z]+){1,2}\\b", "PII.PERSON_NAME", "CLS-PII-NAME-001", 0.80)\n]\n\n# Define stopwords for the PERSON heuristic\nstopwords = {\n    "Full", "Name", "System", "Username", "Email", "Address", "Primary", "Phone", \n    "User", "Role", "Senior", "Systems", "Administrator", "Passport", "Number", \n    "Last", "Login", "IP", "Residential", "Suite", "Portland", "Cyberdyne", "Way",\n    "Social", "Security", "Health", "Insurance"\n}\n\n# Function to check if a name is valid\ndef is_valid_person_name(name):\n    return not any(word in stopwords for word in name.split()) and name[-1] != \':\'\n\n# Detection storage\ndetections = []\nunmatched_identifier_candidates = []\n\n# Running position\npos = 0\n\n# Process each line of the document\nfor line in DOC.splitlines(keepends=True):\n    absolute_offset = pos\n    for pattern, category, classifier_id, confidence in patterns:\n        if category == "PII.PERSON_NAME":\n            # Custom processing for person names\n            for match in re.finditer(pattern, line):\n                match_text = match.group()\n                start = absolute_offset + match.start()\n                end = absolute_offset + match.end()\n                if is_valid_person_name(match_text):\n                    detections.append({\n                        "start": start,\n                        "end": end,\n                        "matched_text": match_text,\n                        "category": category,\n                        "classifier_id": classifier_id,\n                        "confidence": confidence\n                    })\n        else:\n            # General processing for other patterns\n            for match in re.finditer(pattern, line):\n                match_text = match.group()\n                start = absolute_offset + match.start()\n                end = absolute_offset + match.end()\n                detections.append({\n                    "start": start,\n                    "end": end,\n                    "matched_text": match_text,\n                    "category": category,\n                    "classifier_id": classifier_id,\n                    "confidence": confidence\n                })\n    pos += len(line)\n\n# Sort detections by start offset\ndetections = sorted(detections, key=lambda x: x[\'start\'])\n\n# Metadata\ncounts_per_category = defaultdict(int)\nfor detection in detections:\n    counts_per_category[detection["category"]] += 1\n\nmetadata = {\n    "total_detections": len(detections),\n    "counts_per_category": counts_per_category\n}\n\n# Prepare the final results\nfinal_json = {\n    "detections": detections,\n    "metadata": metadata,\n    "unmatched_identifier_candidates": unmatched_identifier_candidates\n}\n\n# Verification\ndoc_length = len(DOC)\nverification = {\n    (det["start"], det["end"]): DOC[det["start"]:det["end"]] == det["matched_text"]\n    for det in detections\n}\n\n(final_json, doc_length, verification)'}, 'extras': {'container_id': 'cntr_6ad5fc6fecf88191ab9773669dae1f5b046a73e3f63550ef'}}, {'type': 'server_tool_result', 'tool_call_id': 'ci_02f1d29b674443e5006ad5fc70f01c87d29121f232d3e148d2', 'status': 'success'}, {'type': 'text', 'text': 'Here is the final JSON output, along with the document length and verification results:\n\n**JSON Output:**\n```json\n{\n    "detections": [\n        {\n            "start": 14,\n            "end": 35,\n            "matched_text": "Marcus Aurelius Vance",\n            "category": "PII.PERSON_NAME",\n            "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-NAME-001",\n            "confidence": 0.8\n        },\n        {\n            "start": 88,\n            "end": 105,\n            "matched_text": "m.vance@gmail.com",\n            "category": "PII.CONTACT.EMAIL",\n            "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-EMAIL-001",\n            "confidence": 0.95\n        },\n        {\n            "start": 124,\n            "end": 141,\n            "matched_text": "+1 (555) 712-4091",\n            "category": "PII.CONTACT.PHONE_NUMBER",\n            "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-PHONE-001",\n            "confidence": 0.9\n        },\n        {\n            "start": 205,\n            "end": 214,\n            "matched_text": "N89201492",\n            "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT",\n            "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001",\n            "confidence": 0.85\n        },\n        {\n            "start": 233,\n            "end": 246,\n            "matched_text": "192.168.10.45",\n            "category": "PII.LOCATION.IP_ADDRESS",\n            "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-IP-001",\n            "confidence": 0.9\n        },\n        {\n            "start": 271,\n            "end": 319,\n            "matched_text": "100 Cyberdyne Way, Suite 400, Portland, OR 97201",\n            "category": "PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS",\n            "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001",\n            "confidence": 0.85\n        },\n        {\n            "start": 347,\n            "end": 358,\n            "matched_text": "483-92-1049",\n            "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.SSN",\n            "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-SSN-001",\n            "confidence": 0.95\n        }\n    ],\n    "metadata": {\n        "total_detections": 7,\n        "counts_per_category": {\n            "PII.PERSON_NAME": 1,\n            "PII.CONTACT.EMAIL": 1,\n            "PII.CONTACT.PHONE_NUMBER": 1,\n            "PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT": 1,\n            "PII.LOCATION.IP_ADDRESS": 1,\n            "PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS": 1,\n            "PII.IDENTIFIER.SSN": 1\n        }\n    },\n    "unmatched_identifier_candidates": []\n}\n```\n\n**Document Length:** 402\n\n**Verification:** All detections were verified as accurate. Each detection\'s `matched_text` exactly matches the segment of the document at the specified `start:end` offsets.', 'annotations': [], 'id': 'msg_02f1d29b674443e5006ad5fc7ef4ac87d2b34f6fa577a53923'}]", "user_id": "snigdhasahoo", "Timestamp": "2026-10-19T12:18:29.254478", "source": "HttpServer", "message_type": "Other", "request_id": "request-7"}
