e)\n- **IP (233–246):** context is `Last Login IP:` — this is a **log/transaction record** address, not patient/medical infrastructure. Classified as PII.LOCATION.IP_ADDRESS at the ruleset confidence; not a "RECORD ID"-type identifier and not PHI.\n- **No date-of-birth context exists.** The document contains no date-like substrings at all, so CLS-PII-DOB-001 correctly yields nothing (the only date-adjacent token, "Last Login", is a transaction label, not a DOB).\n- **Passport (205–214):** confirmed as a passport value (field-labelled `Passport Number:`), not an incidental alphanumeric.\n\n## Tokens NOT covered by any enabled classifier in rev-001 (flagged, not emitted)\n- `HI-902849102-B` @ **[388, 402]** — a health-insurance/member identifier. CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001 requires an `MC|MEM|PAT|REC-` prefix, so this does **not** match. It is likely PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER in substance but cannot be emitted without extending the ruleset, which I am not permitted to do.\n- `mavance_admin` @ **[36, 48]** — a system username; the pinned ruleset contains no USERNAME classifier, so no span can be emitted.\n\nBoth gaps require a **pinned-ruleset revision by the Human Admin** (new classifier + approval token + history entry) if they are to be detected in future runs.\n\n```json\n{\n  "Name": "PII/PHI Span Detection Agent",\n  "Inquiry": "Scan the following document content against the pinned classifier ruleset and return all detected sensitive PII/PHI spans with start/end offsets, category, classifier_id, and confidence. Document content: \'1. Full Name: Marcus Aurelius Vance ... 10. Health Insurance Number: HI-902849102-B\'. The mode is \'Fulfill\'.",\n  "Mode": "Fulfill",\n  "Response": {\n    "ruleset": {"revision_id": "rev-001", "ruleset_version": "1.0.0", "status": "PINNED", "access": "read-only, unmodified"},\n    "document_length": 402,\n    "detections": [\n      {"start": 14, "end": 35, "matched_text": "Marcus Aurelius Vance", "category": "PII.PERSON_NAME", "classifier_id":