 Card Number\n```\ncategory: PII.FINANCIAL.CREDIT_CARD\ntype: regex\npattern: \\b(?:4\\d{3}|5[1-5]\\d{2}|6011|3[47]\\d{2})[- ]?\\d{4}[- ]?\\d{4}[- ]?\\d{4}\\b|\\b\\d{4}-\\d{4}-\\d{4}-\\d{4}\\b\nconfidence_threshold: 0.95\npriority: 1      mask_token: [CREDIT_CARD]\n```\n\n**CLS-PII-IBAN-001** — Bank Account (IBAN)\n```\ncategory: PII.FINANCIAL.BANK_ACCOUNT\ntype: regex\npattern: \\b[A-Z]{2}\\d{2}(?:\\s?[A-Z0-9]{4}){3,7}\\b\nconfidence_threshold: 0.90\npriority: 2      mask_token: [BANK_ACCOUNT]\n```\n\n**CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001** — Residential / Work Street Address\n```\ncategory: PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS\ntype: regex\npattern: \\b\\d{1,5}\\s+[A-Za-z0-9\\s.,]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:[A-Za-z0-9\\s.,#]+)?(?:,\\s+[A-Za-z\\s]+,\\s+[A-Z]{2}\\s+\\d{5}(?:-\\d{4})?)?\\b\nconfidence_threshold: 0.85\npriority: 4      mask_token: [STREET_ADDRESS]\n```\n\n**CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001** — Medical Case Ref / Patient Member ID\n```\ncategory: PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER\ntype: regex\npattern: \\b(?:MC|MEM|PAT|REC)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{4,15}\\b\nconfidence_threshold: 0.90\npriority: 2      mask_token: [MEDICAL_ID]\n```\n\n### All 13 classifiers — priorities / confidence_threshold\n| classifier_id | category | type | priority | confidence_threshold | mask_token |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| CLS-PII-SSN-001 | PII.IDENTIFIER.SSN | regex | 1 | 0.95 | [SSN] |\n| CLS-PII-CC-001 | PII.FINANCIAL.CREDIT_CARD | regex | 1 | 0.95 | [CREDIT_CARD] |\n| CLS-PII-EMAIL-001 | PII.CONTACT.EMAIL | regex | 2 | 0.95 | [EMAIL] |\n| CLS-PII-PHONE-001 | PII.CONTACT.PHONE_NUMBER | regex | 2 | 0.90 | [PHONE_NUMBER] |\n| CLS-PII-IP-001 | PII.LOCATION.IP_ADDRESS | regex | 3 | 0.90 | [IP_ADDRESS] |\n| CLS-PII-DOB-001 | PII.DEMOGRAPHIC.DATE_OF_BIRTH | regex | 3 | 0.85 | [DATE_OF_BIRTH] |\n| CLS-PII-IBAN-001 | PII.FINANCIAL.BANK_ACCOUNT | regex | 2 | 0.90 | [BANK_ACCOUNT] |\n| CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001 | PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT | regex | 3 | 0.85 | [PASSPORT] |\n| CLS-PII-DL-001 | PII.IDENTIFIER.DRIVERS_LICENSE | regex | 3 | 0.85 | [DRIVERS_LICENSE] |\n| CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001 | PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS | regex | 4 | 0.85 | [STREET_ADDRESS] |\n| CLS-PII-NAME-001 | PII.PERSON_NAME | ner (`entity_types: ["PERSON"]`) | 5 | 0.80 | [NAME] |\n| CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001 | PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER | regex | 2 | 0.90 | [MEDICAL_ID] |\n| CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 | PHI.HEALTH_DATA | dictionary_and_heuristic (7 terms) | 3 | 0.85 | [HEALTH_DATA] |\n\n### Requested fields that do not exist in rev-001 (not omissions on my side)\n- **Global PII confidence floor** — there is **no** global/aggregate confidence floor field in the ruleset. Only per-classifier `confidence_threshold` values exist. The lowest PII `confidence_threshold` in rev-001 is **0.80** (CLS-PII-NAME-001, NER); lowest PHI is 0.85 (CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001). Do not cite 0.80 as a "global floor" — it is a per-classifier value only.\n- **Match strategy** — no `match_strategy` / overlapping-match resolution field is defined.\n- **Post-filters / validators** — no post-filter, checksum, Luhn, or validator blocks are defined for any classifier, including CLS-PII-CC-001 (no Luhn validation).\n- **Rendered pattern string** — the stored patterns carry one level of JSON escaping; I have un-escaped them above for legibility. The stored form is `"pattern": "\\\\\\\\b\\\\\\\\d{3}-..."` etc. Cite the file for byte-exact quoting.\n\n### Integrity/consistency observations on the pinned content\n1. `CLS-PII-IBAN-001` is named "IBAN" but its `category` is `PII.FINANCIAL.BANK_ACCOUNT` and mask token is `[BANK_ACCOUNT]` — the `PII.FINANCIAL.types` enum does contain a separate `IBAN` member that no classifier targets.\n2. `CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001` has `category: "PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER"` with **no type suffix**, so it binds to neither `PATIENT_ID` nor `MEDICAL_CASE_REF` in the enum tree.\n3. `CLS-PII-NAME-001` uses `category: "PII.PERSON_NAME"`, a subcategory with no `types` array.\n4. `CLS-PII-CC-001`\'s pattern has a generic fallback