ssigned; contact marcus.vance@example.com and see https://portal.example.com/mavance_admin and administrator"\\ntest_results.append(show("USER capture group",USER,S,1))\\ntest_results.append(show("USER username",USER,"Username: m.vance",1))\\ntest_results.append(show("USER lone",USER,"mavance_admin"))\\ntest_results.append(show("USER in email",USER,"user marcus.vance@example.com"))\\ntest_results.append(show("USER no colon",USER,"Account mavance_admin"))\\n\\n# User2 strict-context variant tests\\ntest_results.append(show("USER2 ctx",USER2,S,1))\\n\\n# Display all test results\\ntest_results\'}, \'extras\': {\'container_id\': \'cntr_6ad6016ab0b881918d40d53419bce7b10913860109b1d72f\'}}, {\'type\': \'server_tool_result\', \'tool_call_id\': \'ci_0fa770bdba4c54b5006ad6016b346087d28beb510e928e68b3\', \'status\': \'success\'}, {\'type\': \'text\', \'text\': "Here are the results of the regex tests:\\n\\n### Credit Card (CC) Regex Tests\\n1. **Visa Split1**\\n   - Input: `\'Visa 4532-\\\\n8910-4321-9081\'`\\n   - Result: Match found `(\'4532-\\\\n8910-4321-9081\')` at span (5, 25)\\n\\n2. **Visa Split3**\\n   - Input: `\'4532-\\\\n8910-\\\\n4321-9081\'`\\n   - Result: Match found `(\'4532-\\\\n8910-\\\\n4321-9081\')` at span (0, 21)\\n\\n3. **Hyphenated**\\n   - Input: `\'4532-8910-4321-9081\'`\\n   - Result: Match found `(\'4532-8910-4321-9081\')` at span (0, 19)\\n\\n4. **Spaces**\\n   - Input: `\'4532  8910  4321  9081\'`\\n   - Result: Match found `(\'4532  8910  4321  9081\')` at span (0, 22)\\n\\n5. **Mixed**\\n   - Input: `\'4532-\\\\n8910 4321-9081\'`\\n   - Result: Match found `(\'4532-\\\\n8910 4321-9081\')` at span (0, 20)\\n\\n6. **12 Digits**\\n   - Input: `\'order 1234\\\\n5678\\\\n9012\'`\\n   - Result: No match\\n\\n7. **Blankline**\\n   - Input: `\'4532-\\\\n\\\\n8910-4321-9081\'`\\n   - Result: No match\\n\\n8. **Dateonly**\\n   - Input: `\'ref 2026\\\\n1016\'`\\n   - Result: No match\\n\\n9. **Starvisa**\\n   - Input: `\'4111111111111111\'`\\n   - Result: Match found `(\'4111111111111111\')` at span (0, 16)\\n\\n10. **Amex Split**\\n    - Input: `\'3782 822463 10005\'`\\n    - Result: No match\\n\\n### USER Regex Tests\\n1. **Capture Group**\\n   - Input: `\'Account: mavance_admin assigned; ...\'`\\n   - Result: Match found `(\'mavance_admin\')` at span (9, 22)\\n\\n2. **Username**\\n   - Input: `\'Username: m.vance\'`\\n   - Result: Match found `(\'m.vance\')` at span (10, 17)\\n\\n3. **Lone**\\n   - Input: `\'mavance_admin\'`\\n   - Result: No match\\n\\n4. **In Email**\\n   - Input: `\'user marcus.vance@example.com\'`\\n   - Result: No match\\n\\n5. **No Colon**\\n   - Input: `\'Account mavance_admin\'`\\n   - Result: No match\\n\\n### USER2 Strict-Context Variant Tests\\n1. **Context**\\n   - Input: `\'Account: mavance_admin assigned; ...\'`\\n   - Result: Match found `(\'mavance_admin\')` at span (9, 22)", \'annotations\': [], \'id\': \'msg_0fa770bdba4c54b5006ad60172135887d2810fec6ea718cd5f\'}]'}
