ccepted_classes\\n\\n    results.append({\\n        \'string\': s,\\n        \'sep1\': repr(sep1),\\n        \'sep2\': repr(sep2),\\n        \'sep3\': repr(sep3),\\n        \'class1\': class1,\\n        \'class2\': class2,\\n        \'class3\': class3,\\n        \'uniform_pass\': uniform_pass\\n    })\\n\\n# Luhn transformation sums\\nluhn_sums = {\\n    \'4111111111111111\': luhn_transform_sum(4111111111111111),\\n    \'4012888888881881\': luhn_transform_sum(4012888888881881),\\n    \'4532891043219081\': luhn_transform_sum(4532891043219081)\\n}\\n\\nresults, luhn_sums"}, \'extras\': {\'container_id\': \'cntr_6ad602ed33a88191ac0040abe9addee50187549d64eeaf6c\'}}, {\'type\': \'server_tool_result\', \'tool_call_id\': \'ci_08d7bb24f926aee1006ad602edc53487d2ad5f80297482003f\', \'status\': \'success\'}, {\'type\': \'text\', \'text\': "Here are the results for each test string and the Luhn transformation sums:\\n\\n### Test Strings and Separators\\n\\n1. **String:** `\'4532-\\\\n8910-4321-9081\'`\\n   - **sep1:** `\'-\\\\\\\\n\'` (Class: NEWLINE_BEARING)\\n   - **sep2:** `\'-\'` (Class: HYPHEN)\\n   - **sep3:** `\'-\'` (Class: HYPHEN)\\n   - **Uniform Pass:** `False`\\n\\n2. **String:** `\'4532 8910 4321 9081\'`\\n   - **sep1:** `\' \'` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\\n   - **sep2:** `\' \'` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\\n   - **sep3:** `\' \'` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\\n   - **Uniform Pass:** `True`\\n\\n3. **String:** `\'4532-8910 4321-9081\'`\\n   - **sep1:** `\'-\'` (Class: HYPHEN)\\n   - **sep2:** `\' \'` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\\n   - **sep3:** `\'-\'` (Class: HYPHEN)\\n   - **Uniform Pass:** `False`\\n\\n4. **String:** `\'4532-\\\\n8910-4321-9081\'`\\n   - **sep1:** `\'-\\\\\\\\n\'` (Class: NEWLINE_BEARING)\\n   - **sep2:** `\'-\'` (Class: HYPHEN)\\n   - **sep3:** `\'-\'` (Class: HYPHEN)\\n   - **Uniform Pass:** `False`\\n\\n5. **String:** `\'4111 1111 1111 1111\'`\\n   - **sep1:** `\' \'` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\\n   - **sep2:** `\' \'` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\\n   - **sep3:** `\' \'` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\\n 