2026-10-19 12:46:19 BST | INFO     | NeuroSan:_log:821 - NeuroSan - {"message": "Result from OpenAI Tool: [{'type': 'server_tool_call', 'name': 'code_interpreter', 'id': 'ci_0abe6fbdbc3cfaea006ad603038c2487d298c65b8150277cfc', 'args': {'code': 'import re\nfrom typing import List, Tuple, Dict\n\n# Patterns\nCC_RE = r\'\\b(?:\\d{4}(?:[ \\t\\-]*\\n?[ \\t\\-]*)){3}\\d{4}\\b\'\nIBAN_RE = r\'\\b[A-Z]{2}\\d{2}(?:[ \\t]*\\n?[ \\t]*[A-Z0-9]{4}){1,7}(?:[ \\t]*\\n?[ \\t]*[A-Z0-9]{1,3})?\\b\'\nADDRESS_RE = r\'\\b\\d{1,5}[ \\t]+(?:[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9.\\-#]*[ \\t]+){0,6}(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)\\b(?:[ \\t]*,[ \\t]*(?:Suite|Ste|Unit|Apt|Bldg|Floor|Fl)[ \\t]*#?[0-9A-Za-z-]+|[ \\t]+(?:Suite|Ste|Unit|Apt|Bldg|Floor|Fl)[ \\t]*#?[0-9A-Za-z-]+)?(?:,[ \\t]+[A-Za-z .]+,[ \\t]+[A-Z]{2}[ \\t]+\\d{5}(?:-\\d{4})?)?\'\nUSERNAME_RE = r\'(?:\\b(?:Account Name|Username|Account|Login|User)[ \\t]*:[ \\t]*)([a-z][a-z0-9._\\-]{2,31})(?![A-Za-z0-9.@\\-])\'\nINSURANCE_RE = r\'\\b[A-Z]{2}-\\d{9}-[A-Z]\\b\'\n\n# Input strings\nstrings = [\n    \'administrator\', \'The US39 code\', \'AB12\', \'1234\\n5678\\n9012\',\n    \'4532-\\n\\n8910-4321-9081\', \'Account mavance_admin\',\n    \'Account: mavance_admin\', \'Account Name: mavance_admin\'\n]\n\ndef passes_luhn(cc_number: str) -> bool:\n    """Check if a credit card number passes the Luhn algorithm."""\n    def digits_of(n):\n        return [int(d) for d in str(n)]\n    digits = digits_of(cc_number)\n    odd_digits = digits[-1::-2]\n    even_digits = digits[-2::-2]\n    checksum = sum(odd_digits)\n    for d in even_digits:\n        checksum += sum(digits_of(d * 2))\n    return checksum % 10 == 0\n\ndef classify_string(s: str) -> List[Tuple[str, int, int, str]]:\n    matches = []\n    \n    # Credit Card\n    cc_matches = re.finditer(CC_RE, s)\n    for match in cc_matches:\n        number = re.sub(r\'[ \\t\\n\\-]\', \'\', match.group())\n        if passes_luhn(number):\n            matches.append((\'CC\', match.start(), match.end(), match.group()))\n    \n    # IBAN\n    iban_matches = re.finditer(IBAN_RE, s)\n    for match in iban_matches:\n        compact_form = re.sub(r\'[ \\t\\n]\', \'\', match.group())\n        if 10 <= len(compact_form) <= 34:\n            matches.append((\'IBAN\', match.start(), match.end(), match.group()))\n    \n    # Address\n    address_matches = re.finditer(ADDRESS_RE, s)\n    for match in address_matches:\n        truncated = match.group().split(\'\\n\', 1)[0]\n        matches.append((\'ADDRESS\', match.start(), match.start() + len(truncated), truncated))\n    \n    # Username\n    username_matches = re.finditer(USERNAME_RE, s)\n    for match in username_matches:\n        matches.append((\'USERNAME\', match.start(1), match.end(1), match.group(1)))\n    \n    # Insurance\n    insurance_matches = re.finditer(INSURANCE_RE, s)\n    for match in insurance_matches:\n        matches.append((\'INSURANCE\', match.start(), match.end(), match.group()))\n    \n    return matches\n\n# Process each string\nresults: Dict[str, List[Tuple[str, int, int, str]]] = {}\nfor s in strings:\n    results[s] = classify_string(s)\n\nresults'}, 'extras': {'container_id': 'cntr_6ad603032ad481919f28b776d3852d5d035a3d2ff6a82d61'}}, {'type': 'server_tool_result', 'tool_call_id': 'ci_0abe6fbdbc3cfaea006ad603038c2487d298c65b8150277cfc', 'status': 'success'}, {'type': 'text', 'text': 'Here are the results after applying the patterns and post-filters:\n\n| String                          | Matches                                    |\n|---------------------------------|--------------------------------------------|\n| administrator                   | []                                         |\n| The US39 code                   | []                                         |\n| AB12                            | []                                         |\n| 1234\\n5678\\n9012                | []                                         |\n| 4532-\\n\\n8910-4321-9081   