ion notations."\n    }\n  ],\n  "history": [\n    {\n      "revision_id": "rev-001",\n      "ruleset_version": "1.0.0",\n      "actor": "Human Admin",\n      "actor_id": "ADMIN-ROOT-001",\n      "timestamp": "2026-10-16T13:30:00Z",\n      "approval_token": "AUTH-TOKEN-ADMIN-REV1-APPROVED-20261016-ROOT",\n      "action": "CREATE_INITIAL_PINNED_REVISION",\n      "diff": {\n        "operation": "INIT",\n        "classifiers_added": 13,\n        "classifiers_removed": 0,\n        "classifiers_modified": 0\n      },\n      "comment": "Initial authoritative baseline provisioned and approved by Human Admin."\n    }\n  ],\n  "pending_admin_review": []\n}\n```\n\nNo write, overwrite, or mutation operation was issued against any file; this was a single read of a 231-line file.\n\n```json\n{\n  "Name": "Master Data Classifiers Ruleset System of Record",\n  "Inquiry": "Provide the complete pinned Master Data Classifiers ruleset at rev-001 (read-only): all enabled classifier definitions (CLS-PII-CC-001, CLS-PII-IBAN-001, CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001, CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001, CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001, CLS-PII-USERNAME-001, and all others), including regex patterns, NER/dictionary/heuristic definitions, label sets, priority, and confidence thresholds. Do not mutate; read-only access for shadow evaluation.",\n  "Mode": "Fulfill",\n  "Response": "Served from master_data_classifiers/ruleset.json at active revision rev-001 (ruleset version 1.0.0, status PINNED, approved by Human Admin ADMIN-ROOT-001 on 2026-10-16T13:30:00Z, integrity hash sha256-rev1-master-data-classifiers-pinned). Full 231-line ruleset content is reproduced verbatim above, comprising: categories (PII subcategories PERSON_NAME, IDENTIFIER, CONTACT, LOCATION, FINANCIAL, DEMOGRAPHIC; PHI subcategories MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER, HEALTH_DATA) and 13 enabled classifiers — CLS-PII-SSN-001, CLS-PII-CC-001, CLS-PII-EMAIL-001, CLS-PII-PHONE-001, CLS-PII-IP-001, CLS-PII-DOB-001, CLS-PII-IBAN-001, CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001, CLS-PII-DL-001, CLS-PI