2026-10-19 13:22:31 BST | INFO     | nsflow:_log:821 - nsflow - 2026-10-19 13:22:31 - generated/hitl_document_redaction_obfuscation_network - INFO - {'otrace': ['orchestrator_supervisor_agent', 'classification_detection_agent'], 'text': 'result from master_classifier_repository_agent\n**Active pinned ruleset: revision `rev-002`, version `1.1.0`, status PINNED** (approved by Human Admin / ADMIN-ROOT-001, 2026-10-19T13:10:00Z, integrity_hash `sha256-rev2-master-data-classifiers-pinned`). Source of record: `master_data_classifiers/ruleset.json` (verified identical in content to `master_data_classifiers/ruleset.yaml`). Read performed strictly read-only; no state mutated.\n\n```json\n{\n  "active_revision_id": "rev-002",\n  "ruleset_version": "1.1.0",\n  "status": "PINNED",\n  "metadata": {\n    "title": "Master Data Classifiers Ruleset",\n    "revision": 2,\n    "revision_id": "rev-002",\n    "ruleset_version": "1.1.0",\n    "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:10:00Z",\n    "created_by": "Human Admin",\n    "approval_actor": "ADMIN-ROOT-001",\n    "approval_token": "AUTH-TOKEN-ADMIN-REV2-APPROVED-20261019-ROOT",\n    "approval_timestamp": "2026-10-19T13:10:00Z",\n    "integrity_hash": "sha256-rev2-master-data-classifiers-pinned",\n    "description": "Revision 2 (rev-002) adding CLS-PII-USERNAME-001 and CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001, credit card line-wrap normalization with soft-fail Luhn (D-8 / Variant A), variable-length final group for IBAN, horizontal whitespace bounding for street address, and tightened username label guard (D-9)."\n  },\n  "categories": {\n    "PII": {\n      "description": "Personally Identifiable Information",\n      "subcategories": {\n        "PERSON_NAME": { "description": "Full or partial names of individuals" },\n        "IDENTIFIER": {\n          "description": "Government or official identity numbers",\n          "types": ["SSN", "NATIONAL_ID", "PASSPORT", "DRIVERS_LICENSE", "USERNAME"]\n        },\n        "CONTACT": {\n          "description": "Direct communication contact information",\n          "types": ["EMAIL", "PHONE_NUMBER"]\n        },\n        "LOCATION": {\n          "description": "Physical addresses and network locations",\n          "types": ["STREET_ADDRESS", "IP_ADDRESS"]\n        },\n        "FINANCIAL": {\n          "description": "Banking, payment, and transaction identifiers",\n          "types": ["CREDIT_CARD", "BANK_ACCOUNT", "IBAN", "CVV"]\n        },\n        "DEMOGRAPHIC": {\n          "description": "Personal demographic attributes",\n          "types": ["DATE_OF_BIRTH"]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "PHI": {\n      "description": "Protected Health Information",\n      "subcategories": {\n        "MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER": {\n          "description": "Patient, member, or clinical record identifiers",\n          "types": ["PATIENT_ID", "MEDICAL_CASE_REF", "HEALTH_INSURANCE_MEMBER_ID"]\n        },\n        "HEALTH_DATA": {\n          "description": "Medical conditions, diagnoses, allergies, and prescriptions",\n          "types": ["ALLERGY", "CONDITION", "PRESCRIPTION", "CLINICAL_NOTE"]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  "classifiers": [\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-SSN-001",\n      "name": "Social Security Number / National ID",\n      "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.SSN",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b\\\\d{3}-\\\\d{2}-\\\\d{4}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.95,\n      "priority": 1,\n      "mask_token": "[SSN]",\n      "description": "Standard 9-digit US Social Security Number in AAA-GG-SSSS format.",\n      "mask_strategy": "partial",\n      "partial_mask_description": "Mask first 5 digits with solid black squares, preserve last 4 digits and hyphens."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-CC-001",\n      "name": "Credit Card Number",\n      "category": "PII.FINANCIAL.CREDIT_CARD",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:(?:4\\\\d{3}|5[1-5]\\\\d{2}|6011|3[47]\\\\d{2}|\\\\d{4})(?:(?:-(?:\\\\n|\\\\r\\\\n)?\\\\d{4}-(?:(?:\\\\n|\\\\r\\\\n)?\\\\d{4})-(?:\\\\n|\\\\r\\\\n)?\\\\d{4})|(?:\\\\s\\\\d{4}\\\\s\\\\d{4}\\\\s\\\\d{4})))\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85,\n      "priority": 1,\n      "mask_token": "[CREDIT_CARD]",\n      "description": "Major credit card numbers with line-wrap support (Variant A hyphen-newline normalization / D-8) and soft-fail Luhn validation.",\n      "validator": "luhn_soft_fail",\n      "validator_rules": {\n        "luhn_pass_confidence": 0.99,\n        "luhn_fail_confidence": 0.86,\n        "threshold": 0.85\n      },\n      "mask_strategy": "partial",\n      "partial_mask_description": "PCI DSS standard: mask all digits except the last 4 digits with solid black squares, preserve delimiters/hyphens."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-EMAIL-001",\n      "name": "Email Address",\n      "category": "PII.CONTACT.EMAIL",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.95,\n      "priority": 2,\n      "mask_token": "[EMAIL]",\n      "description": "Standard RFC-compliant email address format.",\n      "mask_strategy": "partial",\n      "partial_mask_description": "Mask local username before @ with solid black squares, preserve @ and domain name."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-PHONE-001",\n      "name": "Telephone Number",\n      "category": "PII.CONTACT.PHONE_NUMBER",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "(?:\\\\+?1[-. ]?)?(?:\\\\(\\\\d{3}\\\\)|\\\\b\\\\d{3})[-. ]?\\\\d{3}[-. ]?\\\\d{4}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.9,\n      "priority": 2,\n      "mask_token": "[PHONE_NUMBER]",\n      "description": "North American phone numbers with optional country code, parentheses, dashes, or dots.",\n      "mask_strategy": "partial",\n      "partial_mask_description": "Preserve country code (e.g. +1) and formatting punctuation, mask area and subscriber digits with solid black squares."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-IP-001",\n      "name": "IP Address (IPv4 & IPv6)",\n      "category": "PII.LOCATION.IP_ADDRESS",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\\\.){3}(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\\\b|\\\\b(?:[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}:){7}[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.9,\n      "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[IP_ADDRESS]",\n      "description": "IPv4 dotted-decimal and IPv6 8-group addresses.",\n      "mask_strategy": "full"\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-DOB-001",\n      "name": "Date of Birth",\n      "category": "PII.DEMOGRAPHIC.DATE_OF_BIRTH",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:19|20)\\\\d{2}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01])\\\\b|\\\\b(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December)\\\\s+(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01]),\\\\s+(?:19|20)\\\\d{2}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85,\n      "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[DATE_OF_BIRTH]",\n      "description": "ISO-8601 dates and month-name formatted dates of birth.",\n      "mask_strategy": "full"\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-IBAN-001",\n      "name": "Bank Account (IBAN)",\n      "category": "PII.FINANCIAL.IBAN",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b[A-Z]{2}\\\\d{2}(?:\\\\s?[A-Z0-9]{4}){3,7}(?:\\\\s?[A-Z0-9]{1,4})?\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.9,\n      "priority": 2,\n      "mask_token": "[IBAN]",\n      "description": "International Bank Account Numbers with optional spacing and variable-length final block.",\n      "mask_strategy": "partial",\n      "partial_mask_description": "Preserve country code + check digits (first 4 chars) and last 2-4 digits, mask routing and account alphanumeric chars with solid black squares."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001",\n      "name": "Passport Number",\n      "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b[A-Z]\\\\d{8,9}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85,\n      "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[PASSPORT]",\n      "description": "Standard alphanumeric passport identifiers.",\n      "mask_strategy": "full"\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-DL-001",\n      "name": "Driver\'s License",\n      "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.DRIVERS_LICENSE",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\bDL-[A-Z0-9]{6,12}(?:-[A-Z]{2})?\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85,\n      "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[DRIVERS_LICENSE]",\n      "description": "Standard state driver\'s license numbers with DL- prefix.",\n      "mask_strategy": "full"\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001",\n      "name": "Residential / Work Street Address",\n      "category": "PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b\\\\d{1,5}[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z0-9., \\\\t]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:,?[ \\\\t]+(?:Suite|Ste|Apt|Unit|#)[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z0-9-]+)?,[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z \\\\t]+,[ \\\\t]+[A-Z]{2}[ \\\\t]+\\\\d{5}(?:-\\\\d{4})?\\\\b|\\\\b\\\\d{1,5}[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z0-9., \\\\t]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:,?[ \\\\t]+(?:Suite|Ste|Apt|Unit|#)[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z0-9-]+)?\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85,\n      "priority": 4,\n      "mask_token": "[STREET_ADDRESS]",\n      "description": "Physical postal street address constrained to horizontal whitespace to prevent newline over-matching.",\n      "mask_strategy": "partial",\n      "partial_mask_description": "Mask street number and street name with solid black squares, preserve city, state, zip code."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-NAME-001",\n      "name": "Full Name / Individual Name",\n      "category": "PII.PERSON_NAME",\n      "type": "ner",\n      "entity_types": ["PERSON"],\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.8,\n      "priority": 5,\n      "mask_token": "[NAME]",\n      "description": "Named entity person recognizer for personal and professional names.",\n      "mask_strategy": "full"\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001",\n      "name": "Medical Case Ref / Patient Member ID",\n      "category": "PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:MC|MEM|PAT|REC)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{4,15}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.9,\n      "priority": 2,\n      "mask_token": "[MEDICAL_ID]",\n      "description": "Identifiers for medical case references, patient IDs, member IDs.",\n      "mask_strategy": "full"\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001",\n      "name": "Health Condition / Prescription / Allergy",\n      "category": "PHI.HEALTH_DATA",\n      "type": "dictionary_and_heuristic",\n      "terms": [\n        "penicillin allergy",\n        "allergy",\n        "Hypertension",\n        "hypertension",\n        "prescription adjustment",\n        "emergency dispensation",\n        "medical dispensation"\n      ],\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85,\n      "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[HEALTH_DATA]",\n      "description": "Clinical health condition diagnoses, allergies, and prescription notations.",\n      "mask_strategy": "full"\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-USERNAME-001",\n      "name": "System Account Username",\n      "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.USERNAME",\n      "type": "regex_context",\n      "pattern": "(?i:\\\\b(?:Account Name|Username|User Name|Login|Account):[ \\\\t]*)(?!Role\\\\b)([a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9._-]{2,30})\\\\b",\n      "confidence": 0.86,\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85,\n      "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[USERNAME]",\n      "description": "System account username anchored by tightened label context with negative lookahead guard against Role labels (D-9).",\n      "mask_strategy": "full"\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001",\n      "name": "Health Insurance Member ID / Policy Number",\n      "category": "PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER.HEALTH_INSURANCE_MEMBER_ID",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:HI|INS|POL|GRP)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{6,16}\\\\b|(?i:\\\\bHealth Insurance (?:Number|ID|Member ID):[ \\\\t]*)([A-Za-z0-9-]+)\\\\b",\n      "confidence": 0.9,\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85,\n      "priority": 2,\n      "mask_token": "[INSURANCE_ID]",\n      "description": "Health insurance member identifier, policy number, or group ID.",\n      "mask_strategy": "partial",\n      "partial_mask_description": "Preserve plan prefix (e.g. HI-) and suffix code, mask member digits with solid black squares."\n    }\n  ],\n  "history": [\n    {\n      "revision_id": "rev-001",\n      "ruleset_version": "1.0.0",\n      "actor": "Human Admin",\n      "actor_id": "ADMIN-ROOT-001",\n      "timestamp": "2026-10-16T13:30:00Z",\n      "approval_token": "AUTH-TOKEN-ADMIN-REV1-APPROVED-20261016-ROOT",\n      "action": "CREATE_INITIAL_PINNED_REVISION",\n      "diff": { "operation": "INIT", "classifiers_added": 13, "classifiers_removed": 0, "classifiers_modified": 0 },\n      "comment": "Initial authoritative baseline provisioned and approved by Human Admin."\n    },\n    {\n      "revision_id": "rev-002",\n      "ruleset_version": "1.1.0",\n      "actor": "Human Admin",\n      "actor_id": "ADMIN-ROOT-001",\n      "timestamp": "2026-10-19T13:10:00Z",\n      "approval_token": "AUTH-TOKEN-ADMIN-REV2-APPROVED-20261019-ROOT",\n      "action": "UPDATE_PINNED_REVISION",\n      "diff": {\n        "operation": "UPDATE",\n        "classifiers_added": 2,\n        "classifiers_removed": 0,\n        "classifiers_modified": 3,\n        "added_classifier_ids": ["CLS-PII-USERNAME-001", "CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001"],\n        "modified_classifier_ids": ["CLS-PII-CC-001", "CLS-PII-IBAN-001", "CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001"]\n      },\n      "comment": "Revision 2 (rev-002) approved with D-8 (Variant A credit card newline normalization) and D-9 (tightened username label guard)."\n    }\n  ],\n  "pending_admin_review": []\n}\n```\n\nNotes for deterministic application, all drawn verbatim from the pinned revision:\n- 15 classifiers total: 11 `regex`, 1 `regex_context`, 1 `ner`, 1 `dictionary_and_heuristic`, plus the regex-based CC validator path.\n- Span priority is numeric, 1 = highest precedence (SSN, CREDIT_CARD) through 5 (NAME); use it to resolve overlapping spans.\n- NER entity types: `PERSON` only (CLS-PII-NAME-001).\n- Dictionary/heuristic terms: exactly the 7 listed in CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001.\n- Confidence thresholds range 0.8–0.95; the only dynamic validator is `luhn_soft_fail` on credit cards (pass → 0.99, fail → 0.86, threshold 0.85, i.e. soft-fail still masks).\n- Two classifiers carry both `confidence` and `confidence_threshold` (USERNAME 0.86/0.85; INSURANCE 0.9/0.85); the gate is `confidence_threshold`.\n- `pending_admin_review` is empty, so `rev-002` is the current authoritative state.\n\n{\n  "Name": "master_data_classifiers_ruleset_registry",\n  "Inquiry": "Provide the active pinned Master Data Classifiers ruleset (revision rev-002, version 1.1.0) in strict read-only form. I need all enabled PII/PHI categories, regex patterns, NER entity types, dictionary term lists, heuristics, span priority values, and confidence thresholds so I can apply them deterministically to a document. Please return the ruleset contents or a precise machine-readable specification.",\n  "Mode": "Fulfill",\n  "Response": "Served the full ruleset content from master_data_classifiers/ruleset.json (mirrored verbatim in ruleset.yaml), active revision rev-002, ruleset version 1.1.0, status PINNED, approved by Human Admin (ADMIN-ROOT-001, 2026-10-19T13:10:00Z), integrity_hash sha256-rev2-master-data-classifiers-pinned. Read-only access, no state mutation. Contents include full categories (PII: PERSON_NAME, IDENTIFIER, CONTACT, LOCATION, FINANCIAL, DEMOGRAPHIC; PHI: MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER, HEALTH_DATA) and all 15 classifiers with patterns, NER entity types (PERSON), dictionary terms (7), validators (luhn_soft_fail: pass 0.99 / fail 0.86 / threshold 0.85), priorities 1-5, confidence thresholds 0.8-0.95, mask tokens, and mask strategies, plus rev-001/rev-002 history and empty pending_admin_review."\n}'}
