ED-ID-001 | Medical Case Ref / Patient Member ID | PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER | regex | 0.90 | 2 | full |\n| 13 | CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 | Health Condition / Prescription / Allergy | PHI.HEALTH_DATA | **dictionary_and_heuristic** (7 terms) | 0.85 | 3 | full |\n| 14 | CLS-PII-USERNAME-001 | System Account Username | PII.IDENTIFIER.USERNAME | regex_context | 0.85 (confidence 0.86) | 3 | full |\n| 15 | CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001 | Health Insurance Member ID / Policy Number | PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER.HEALTH_INSURANCE_MEMBER_ID | regex | 0.85 (confidence 0.90) | 2 | partial |\n\nCategories: **PII** (subcategories PERSON_NAME, IDENTIFIER{SSN, NATIONAL_ID, PASSPORT, DRIVERS_LICENSE, USERNAME}, CONTACT{EMAIL, PHONE_NUMBER}, LOCATION{STREET_ADDRESS, IP_ADDRESS}, FINANCIAL{CREDIT_CARD, BANK_ACCOUNT, IBAN, CVV}, DEMOGRAPHIC{DATE_OF_BIRTH}) and **PHI** (MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER{PATIENT_ID, MEDICAL_CASE_REF, HEALTH_INSURANCE_MEMBER_ID}, HEALTH_DATA{ALLERGY, CONDITION, PRESCRIPTION, CLINICAL_NOTE}).\n\nFull raw content (unescaped patterns):\n\n```json\n{\n  "active_revision_id": "rev-002",\n  "ruleset_version": "1.1.0",\n  "status": "PINNED",\n  "metadata": {\n    "title": "Master Data Classifiers Ruleset", "revision": 2, "revision_id": "rev-002",\n    "ruleset_version": "1.1.0", "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:10:00Z", "created_by": "Human Admin",\n    "approval_actor": "ADMIN-ROOT-001",\n    "approval_token": "AUTH-TOKEN-ADMIN-REV2-APPROVED-20261019-ROOT",\n    "approval_timestamp": "2026-10-19T13:10:00Z",\n    "integrity_hash": "sha256-rev2-master-data-classifiers-pinned",\n    "description": "Revision 2 (rev-002) adding CLS-PII-USERNAME-001 and CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001, credit card line-wrap normalization with soft-fail Luhn (D-8 / Variant A), variable-length final group for IBAN, horizontal whitespace bounding for street address, and tightened username label guard (D-9)."\n  },\n  "categories": { /* as tabulated above; PII + PHI subcategories and types */ },\n  "classifiers": [\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-SSN-001", "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.SSN", "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b\\\\d{3}-\\\\d{2}-\\\\d{4}\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.95, "priority": 1,\n      "mask_token": "[SSN]", "mask_strategy": "partial" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-CC-001", "category": "PII.FINANCIAL.CREDIT_CARD", "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:(?:4\\\\d{3}|5[1-5]\\\\d{2}|6011|3[47]\\\\d{2}|\\\\d{4})(?:(?:-(?:\\\\n|\\\\r\\\\n)?\\\\d{4}-(?:(?:\\\\n|\\\\r\\\\n)?\\\\d{4})-(?:\\\\n|\\\\r\\\\n)?\\\\d{4})|(?:\\\\s\\\\d{4}\\\\s\\\\d{4}\\\\s\\\\d{4})))\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 1, "mask_token": "[CREDIT_CARD]",\n      "validator": "luhn_soft_fail",\n      "validator_rules": { "luhn_pass_confidence": 0.99, "luhn_fail_confidence": 0.86, "threshold": 0.85 },\n      "mask_strategy": "partial" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-EMAIL-001", "category": "PII.CONTACT.EMAIL", "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.95, "priority": 2, "mask_token": "[EMAIL]", "mask_strategy": "partial" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-PHONE-001", "category": "PII.CONTACT.PHONE_NUMBER", "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "(?:\\\\+?1[-. ]?)?(?:\\\\(\\\\d{3}\\\\)|\\\\b\\\\d{3})[-. ]?\\\\d{3}[-. ]?\\\\d{4}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.9, "priority": 2, "mask_token": "[PHONE_NUMBER]", "mask_strategy": "partial" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-IP-001", "category": "PII.LOCATION.IP_ADDRESS", "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\\\.){3}(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\\\b|\\\\b(?:[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}:){7}[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.9, "priority": 3, "mask_token": "[IP_ADDRESS]", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-DOB-001", "category": "PII.DEMOGRAPHIC.DATE_OF_BIRTH", "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:19|20)\\\\d{2}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01])\\\\b|\\\\b(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December)\\\\s+(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01]),\\\\s+(?:19|20)\\\\d{2}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 3, "mask_token": "[DATE_OF_BIRTH]", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-IBAN-001", "category": "PII.FINANCIAL.IBAN", "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b[A-Z]{2}\\\\d{2}(?:\\\\s?[A-Z0-9]{4}){3,7}(?:\\\\s?[A-Z0-9]{1,4})?\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.9, "priority": 2, "mask_token": "[IBAN]", "mask_strategy": "partial" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001", "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT", "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b[A-Z]\\\\d{8,9}\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[PASSPORT]", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-DL-001", "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.DRIVERS_LICENSE", "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\bDL-[A-Z0-9]{6,12}(?:-[A-Z]{2})?\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[DRIVERS_LICENSE]", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001", "category": "PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS", "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b\\\\d{1,5}[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z0-9., \\\\t]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:,?[ \\\\t]+(?:Suite|Ste|Apt|Unit|#)[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z0-9-]+)?,[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z \\\\t]+,[ \\\\t]+[A-Z]{2}[ \\\\t]+\\\\d{5}(?:-\\\\d{4})?\\\\b|\\\\b\\\\d{1,5}[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z0-9., \\\\t]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:,?[ \\\\t]+(?:Suite|Ste|Apt|Unit|#)[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z0-9-]+)?\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 4, "mask_token": "[STREET_ADDRESS]", "mask_strategy": "partial" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-NAME-001", "category": "PII.PERSON_NAME", "type": "ner",\n      "entity_types": ["PERSON"], "confidence_threshold": 0.8, "priority": 5,\n      "mask_token": "[NAME]", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001", "category": "PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER", "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:MC|MEM|PAT|REC)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{4,15}\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.9,\n      "priority": 2, "mask_token": "[MEDICAL_ID]", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001", "category": "PHI.HEALTH_DATA", "type": "dictionary_and_heuristic",\n      "terms": ["penicillin allergy", "allergy", "Hypertension", "hypertension",\n                "prescription adjustment", "emergency dispensation", "medical dispensation"],\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 3, "mask_token": "[HEALTH_DATA]", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-USERNAME-001", "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.USERNAME", "type": "regex_context",\n      "pattern": "(?i:\\\\b(?:Account Name|Username|User Name|Login|Account):[ \\\\t]*)(?!Role\\\\b)([a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9._-]{2,30})\\\\b",\n      "confidence": 0.86, "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[USERNAME]", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001", "category": "PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER.HEALTH_INSURANCE_MEMBER_ID",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:HI|INS|POL|GRP)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{6,16}\\\\b|(?i:\\\\bHealth Insurance (?:Number|ID|Member ID):[ \\\\t]*)([A-Za-z0-9-]+)\\\\b",\n      "confidence": 0.9, "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 2,\n      "mask_token": "[INSURANCE_ID]", "mask_strategy": "partial" }\n  ],\n  "history": [\n    { "revision_id": "rev-001", "ruleset_version": "1.0.0", "action": "CREATE_INITIAL_PINNED_REVISION",\n      "classifiers_added": 13, "timestamp": "2026-10-16T13:30:00Z",\n      "approval_token": "AUTH-TOKEN-ADMIN-REV1-APPROVED-20261016-ROOT" },\n    { "revision_id": "rev-002", "ruleset_version": "1.1.0", "action": "UPDATE_PINNED_REVISION",\n      "classifiers_added": 2, "classifiers_removed": 0, "classifiers_modified": 3,\n      "added_classifier_ids": ["CLS-PII-USERNAME-001", "CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001"],\n      "modified_classifier_ids": ["CLS-PII-CC-001", "CLS-PII-IBAN-001", "CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001"],\n      "timestamp": "2026-10-19T13:10:00Z",\n      "approval_token": "AUTH-TOKEN-ADMIN-REV2-APPROVED-20261019-ROOT" }\n  ],\n  "pending_admin_review": []\n}\n```\n\nNotes for citation: revision `rev-002` diff vs `rev-001` = 2 added, 0 removed, 3 modified. No pending admin review items. The YAML mirror at `master_data_classifiers/ruleset.yaml` carries the same rev-002 pin if you prefer that format — say the word and I\'ll serve it.\n\n```json\n{\n  "Name": "Master Data Classifiers Ruleset System of Record",\n  "Inquiry": "Fulfill: Provide the active pinned Master Data Classifiers ruleset (revision rev-002 / version 1.1.0) in strict read-only mode. I need all enabled classifiers: regex patterns, NER models, dictionary term lists, heuristics, category names/IDs, classifier IDs, and confidence thresholds. Return the full ruleset definition (ruleset.json/yaml content or equivalent structured listing).",\n  "Mode": "Fulfill",\n  "Response": "Served from master_data_classifiers/ruleset.json in strict read-only mode (no state mutated). Active revision rev-002, ruleset version 1.1.0, status PINNED, approved by Human Admin (ADMIN-ROOT-001) 2026-10-19T13:10:00Z, integrity_hash sha256-rev2-master-data-classifiers-pinned. Contains 15 classifiers, all enabled: CLS-PII-SSN-001 (regex, 0.95), CLS-PII-CC-001 (regex + luhn_soft_fail, 0.85), CLS-PII-EMAIL-001 (regex, 0.95), CLS-PII-PHONE-001 (regex, 0.90), CLS-PII-IP-001 (regex, 0.90), CLS-PII-DOB-001 (regex, 0.85), CLS-PII-IBAN-001 (regex, 0.90), CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001 (regex, 0.85), CLS-PII-DL-001 (regex, 0.85), CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001 (regex, 0.85), CLS-PII-NAME-001 (NER entity PERSON, 0.80), CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001 (regex, 0.90), CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 (dictionary_and_heuristic, 7 terms, 0.85), CLS-PII-USERNAME-001 (regex_context, 0.85, added rev-002), CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001 (regex, 0.85, added rev-002). Categories PII (PERSON_NAME, IDENTIFIER, CONTACT, LOCATION, FINANCIAL, DEMOGRAPHIC) and PHI (MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER, HEALTH_DATA). Full patterns, mask tokens/strategies, priorities, validator rules, and revision history (rev-001 13 classifiers -> rev-002 +2 added/3 modified) returned in the structured listing above; YAML mirror master_data_classifiers/ruleset.yaml holds the same pin."\n}\n```'}
