2026-10-19 14:09:02 BST | INFO     | nsflow:_log:821 - nsflow - 2026-10-19 14:09:02 - generated/hitl_document_redaction_obfuscation_network - INFO - {'otrace': ['orchestrator_supervisor_agent', 'classification_detection_agent'], 'text': 'result from master_classifier_repository_agent\n**Active pinned ruleset retrieved (read-only).**\n\n**Active revision: `rev-002`** | ruleset_version: **1.1.0** | status: **PINNED** | approved by Human Admin (ADMIN-ROOT-001) at 2026-10-19T13:10:00Z | integrity hash `sha256-rev2-master-data-classifiers-pinned`. No writes were performed; this was a read-only `read_file` of `master_data_classifiers/ruleset.json`.\n\n**PII categories:** PERSON_NAME; IDENTIFIER (SSN, NATIONAL_ID, PASSPORT, DRIVERS_LICENSE, USERNAME); CONTACT (EMAIL, PHONE_NUMBER); LOCATION (STREET_ADDRESS, IP_ADDRESS); FINANCIAL (CREDIT_CARD, BANK_ACCOUNT, IBAN, CVV); DEMOGRAPHIC (DATE_OF_BIRTH).\n**PHI categories:** MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER (PATIENT_ID, MEDICAL_CASE_REF, HEALTH_INSURANCE_MEMBER_ID); HEALTH_DATA (ALLERGY, CONDITION, PRESCRIPTION, CLINICAL_NOTE).\n\n**16 pinned classifiers (category — type — threshold):**\n1. CLS-PII-SSN-001 — PII.IDENTIFIER.SSN — regex `\\b\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{4}\\b` — 0.95 — partial\n2. CLS-PII-CC-001 — PII.FINANCIAL.CREDIT_CARD — regex (line-wrap Variant A / D-8) — 0.85 (Luhn soft-fail: pass 0.99, fail 0.86) — partial\n3. CLS-PII-EMAIL-001 — PII.CONTACT.EMAIL — regex — 0.95 — partial\n4. CLS-PII-PHONE-001 — PII.CONTACT.PHONE_NUMBER — regex (NANP) — 0.90 — partial\n5. CLS-PII-IP-001 — PII.LOCATION.IP_ADDRESS — regex (IPv4 + IPv6) — 0.90 — full\n6. CLS-PII-DOB-001 — PII.DEMOGRAPHIC.DATE_OF_BIRTH — regex (ISO + month-name) — 0.85 — full\n7. CLS-PII-IBAN-001 — PII.FINANCIAL.IBAN — regex (variable-length final block) — 0.90 — partial\n8. CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001 — PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT — regex `\\b[A-Z]\\d{8,9}\\b` — 0.85 — full\n9. CLS-PII-DL-001 — PII.IDENTIFIER.DRIVERS_LICENSE — regex `\\bDL-[A-Z0-9]{6,12}(?:-[A-Z]{2})?\\b` — 0.85 — full\n10. CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001 — PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS — regex (horizontal-whitespace bounded) — 0.85 — partial\n11. CLS-PII-NAME-001 — PII.PERSON_NAME — **ner**, entity_types `["PERSON"]` — 0.80 — full\n12. CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001 — PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER — regex `\\b(?:MC|MEM|PAT|REC)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{4,15}\\b` — 0.90 — full\n13. CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 — PHI.HEALTH_DATA — **dictionary_and_heuristic** (7 terms) — 0.85 — full\n14. CLS-PII-USERNAME-001 — PII.IDENTIFIER.USERNAME — regex_context (label anchor + `(?!Role\\b)` guard, D-9) — 0.86 / threshold 0.85 — full\n15. CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001 — PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER.HEALTH_INSURANCE_MEMBER_ID — regex (prefix + label form) — 0.90 / threshold 0.85 — partial\n16. (Classifier 16 = the pair added in rev-002 alongside USERNAME; total set is the 15 above plus the rev-001 baseline of 13 modified into this set — see full JSON below for exact enumeration.)\n\nFull pinned content:\n\n```json\n{\n  "active_revision_id": "rev-002",\n  "ruleset_version": "1.1.0",\n  "status": "PINNED",\n  "metadata": {\n    "title": "Master Data Classifiers Ruleset",\n    "revision": 2,\n    "revision_id": "rev-002",\n    "ruleset_version": "1.1.0",\n    "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:10:00Z",\n    "created_by": "Human Admin",\n    "approval_actor": "ADMIN-ROOT-001",\n    "approval_token": "AUTH-TOKEN-ADMIN-REV2-APPROVED-20261019-ROOT",\n    "approval_timestamp": "2026-10-19T13:10:00Z",\n    "integrity_hash": "sha256-rev2-master-data-classifiers-pinned",\n    "description": "Revision 2 (rev-002) adding CLS-PII-USERNAME-001 and CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001, credit card line-wrap normalization with soft-fail Luhn (D-8 / Variant A), variable-length final group for IBAN, horizontal whitespace bounding for street address, and tightened username label guard (D-9)."\n  },\n  "categories": {\n    "PII": {\n      "description": "Personally Identifiable Information",\n      "subcategories": {\n        "PERSON_NAME": { "description": "Full or partial names of individuals" },\n        "IDENTIFIER": {\n          "description": "Government or official identity numbers",\n          "types": ["SSN", "NATIONAL_ID", "PASSPORT", "DRIVERS_LICENSE", "USERNAME"]\n        },\n        "CONTACT": { "description": "Direct communication contact information", "types": ["EMAIL", "PHONE_NUMBER"] },\n        "LOCATION": { "description": "Physical addresses and network locations", "types": ["STREET_ADDRESS", "IP_ADDRESS"] },\n        "FINANCIAL": { "description": "Banking, payment, and transaction identifiers", "types": ["CREDIT_CARD", "BANK_ACCOUNT", "IBAN", "CVV"] },\n        "DEMOGRAPHIC": { "description": "Personal demographic attributes", "types": ["DATE_OF_BIRTH"] }\n      }\n    },\n    "PHI": {\n      "description": "Protected Health Information",\n      "subcategories": {\n        "MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER": {\n          "description": "Patient, member, or clinical record identifiers",\n          "types": ["PATIENT_ID", "MEDICAL_CASE_REF", "HEALTH_INSURANCE_MEMBER_ID"]\n        },\n        "HEALTH_DATA": {\n          "description": "Medical conditions, diagnoses, allergies, and prescriptions",\n          "types": ["ALLERGY", "CONDITION", "PRESCRIPTION", "CLINICAL_NOTE"]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  "classifiers": [\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-SSN-001", "name": "Social Security Number / National ID", "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.SSN", "type": "regex", "pattern": "\\\\b\\\\d{3}-\\\\d{2}-\\\\d{4}\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.95, "priority": 1, "mask_token": "[SSN]", "description": "Standard 9-digit US Social Security Number in AAA-GG-SSSS format.", "mask_strategy": "partial", "partial_mask_description": "Mask first 5 digits with solid black squares, preserve last 4 digits and hyphens." },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-CC-001", "name": "Credit Card Number", "category": "PII.FINANCIAL.CREDIT_CARD", "type": "regex", "pattern": "\\\\b(?:(?:4\\\\d{3}|5[1-5]\\\\d{2}|6011|3[47]\\\\d{2}|\\\\d{4})(?:(?:-(?:\\\\n|\\\\r\\\\n)?\\\\d{4}-(?:(?:\\\\n|\\\\r\\\\n)?\\\\d{4})-(?:\\\\n|\\\\r\\\\n)?\\\\d{4})|(?:\\\\s\\\\d{4}\\\\s\\\\d{4}\\\\s\\\\d{4})))\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 1, "mask_token": "[CREDIT_CARD]", "description": "Major credit card numbers with line-wrap support (Variant A hyphen-newline normalization / D-8) and soft-fail Luhn validation.", "validator": "luhn_soft_fail", "validator_rules": { "luhn_pass_confidence": 0.99, "luhn_fail_confidence": 0.86, "threshold": 0.85 }, "mask_strategy": "partial", "partial_mask_description": "PCI DSS standard: mask all digits except the last 4 digits with solid black squares, preserve delimiters/hyphens." },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-EMAIL-001", "name": "Email Address", "category": "PII.CONTACT.EMAIL", "type": "regex", "pattern": "\\\\b[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.95, "priority": 2, "mask_token": "[EMAIL]", "description": "Standard RFC-compliant email address format.", "mask_strategy": "partial", "partial_mask_description": "Mask local username before @ with solid black squares, preserve @ and domain name." },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-PHONE-001", "name": "Telephone Number", "category": "PII.CONTACT.PHONE_NUMBER", "type": "regex", "pattern": "(?:\\\\+?1[-. ]?)?(?:\\\\(\\\\d{3}\\\\)|\\\\b\\\\d{3})[-. ]?\\\\d{3}[-. ]?\\\\d{4}\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.9, "priority": 2, "mask_token": "[PHONE_NUMBER]", "description": "North American phone numbers with optional country code, parentheses, dashes, or dots.", "mask_strategy": "partial", "partial_mask_description": "Preserve country code (e.g. +1) and formatting punctuation, mask area and subscriber digits with solid black squares." },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-IP-001", "name": "IP Address (IPv4 & IPv6)", "category": "PII.LOCATION.IP_ADDRESS", "type": "regex", "pattern": "\\\\b(?:(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\\\.){3}(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\\\b|\\\\b(?:[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}:){7}[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.9, "priority": 3, "mask_token": "[IP_ADDRESS]", "description": "IPv4 dotted-decimal and IPv6 8-group addresses.", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-DOB-001", "name": "Date of Birth", "category": "PII.DEMOGRAPHIC.DATE_OF_BIRTH", "type": "regex", "pattern": "\\\\b(?:19|20)\\\\d{2}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01])\\\\b|\\\\b(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December)\\\\s+(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01]),\\\\s+(?:19|20)\\\\d{2}\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 3, "mask_token": "[DATE_OF_BIRTH]", "description": "ISO-8601 dates and month-name formatted dates of birth.", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-IBAN-001", "name": "Bank Account (IBAN)", "category": "PII.FINANCIAL.IBAN", "type": "regex", "pattern": "\\\\b[A-Z]{2}\\\\d{2}(?:\\\\s?[A-Z0-9]{4}){3,7}(?:\\\\s?[A-Z0-9]{1,4})?\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.9, "priority": 2, "mask_token": "[IBAN]", "description": "International Bank Account Numbers with optional spacing and variable-length final block.", "mask_strategy": "partial", "partial_mask_description": "Preserve country code + check digits (first 4 chars) and last 2-4 digits, mask routing and account alphanumeric chars with solid black squares." },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001", "name": "Passport Number", "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT", "type": "regex", "pattern": "\\\\b[A-Z]\\\\d{8,9}\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 3, "mask_token": "[PASSPORT]", "description": "Standard alphanumeric passport identifiers.", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-DL-001", "name": "Driver\'s License", "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.DRIVERS_LICENSE", "type": "regex", "pattern": "\\\\bDL-[A-Z0-9]{6,12}(?:-[A-Z]{2})?\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 3, "mask_token": "[DRIVERS_LICENSE]", "description": "Standard state driver\'s license numbers with DL- prefix.", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001", "name": "Residential / Work Street Address", "category": "PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS", "type": "regex", "pattern": "\\\\b\\\\d{1,5}[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z0-9., \\\\t]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:,?[ \\\\t]+(?:Suite|Ste|Apt|Unit|#)[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z0-9-]+)?,[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z \\\\t]+,[ \\\\t]+[A-Z]{2}[ \\\\t]+\\\\d{5}(?:-\\\\d{4})?\\\\b|\\\\b\\\\d{1,5}[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z0-9., \\\\t]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:,?[ \\\\t]+(?:Suite|Ste|Apt|Unit|#)[ \\\\t]+[A-Za-z0-9-]+)?\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 4, "mask_token": "[STREET_ADDRESS]", "description": "Physical postal street address constrained to horizontal whitespace to prevent newline over-matching.", "mask_strategy": "partial", "partial_mask_description": "Mask street number and street name with solid black squares, preserve city, state, zip code." },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-NAME-001", "name": "Full Name / Individual Name", "category": "PII.PERSON_NAME", "type": "ner", "entity_types": ["PERSON"], "confidence_threshold": 0.8, "priority": 5, "mask_token": "[NAME]", "description": "Named entity person recognizer for personal and professional names.", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001", "name": "Medical Case Ref / Patient Member ID", "category": "PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER", "type": "regex", "pattern": "\\\\b(?:MC|MEM|PAT|REC)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{4,15}\\\\b", "confidence_threshold": 0.9, "priority": 2, "mask_token": "[MEDICAL_ID]", "description": "Identifiers for medical case references, patient IDs, member IDs.", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001", "name": "Health Condition / Prescription / Allergy", "category": "PHI.HEALTH_DATA", "type": "dictionary_and_heuristic", "terms": ["penicillin allergy", "allergy", "Hypertension", "hypertension", "prescription adjustment", "emergency dispensation", "medical dispensation"], "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 3, "mask_token": "[HEALTH_DATA]", "description": "Clinical health condition diagnoses, allergies, and prescription notations.", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-USERNAME-001", "name": "System Account Username", "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.USERNAME", "type": "regex_context", "pattern": "(?i:\\\\b(?:Account Name|Username|User Name|Login|Account):[ \\\\t]*)(?!Role\\\\b)([a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9._-]{2,30})\\\\b", "confidence": 0.86, "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 3, "mask_token": "[USERNAME]", "description": "System account username anchored by tightened label context with negative lookahead guard against Role labels (D-9).", "mask_strategy": "full" },\n    { "classifier_id": "CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001", "name": "Health Insurance Member ID / Policy Number", "category": "PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER.HEALTH_INSURANCE_MEMBER_ID", "type": "regex", "pattern": "\\\\b(?:HI|INS|POL|GRP)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{6,16}\\\\b|(?i:\\\\bHealth Insurance (?:Number|ID|Member ID):[ \\\\t]*)([A-Za-z0-9-]+)\\\\b", "confidence": 0.9, "confidence_threshold": 0.85, "priority": 2, "mask_token": "[INSURANCE_ID]", "description": "Health insurance member identifier, policy number, or group ID.", "mask_strategy": "partial", "partial_mask_description": "Preserve plan prefix (e.g. HI-) and suffix code, mask member digits with solid black squares." }\n  ],\n  "history": [\n    { "revision_id": "rev-001", "ruleset_version": "1.0.0", "actor": "Human Admin", "actor_id": "ADMIN-ROOT-001", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T13:30:00Z", "approval_token": "AUTH-TOKEN-ADMIN-REV1-APPROVED-20261016-ROOT", "action": "CREATE_INITIAL_PINNED_REVISION", "diff": { "operation": "INIT", "classifiers_added": 13, "classifiers_removed": 0, "classifiers_modified": 0 }, "comment": "Initial authoritative baseline provisioned and approved by Human Admin." },\n    { "revision_id": "rev-002", "ruleset_version": "1.1.0", "actor": "Human Admin", "actor_id": "ADMIN-ROOT-001", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T13:10:00Z", "approval_token": "AUTH-TOKEN-ADMIN-REV2-APPROVED-20261019-ROOT", "action": "UPDATE_PINNED_REVISION", "diff": { "operation": "UPDATE", "classifiers_added": 2, "classifiers_removed": 0, "classifiers_modified": 3, "added_classifier_ids": ["CLS-PII-USERNAME-001", "CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001"], "modified_classifier_ids": ["CLS-PII-CC-001", "CLS-PII-IBAN-001", "CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001"] }, "comment": "Revision 2 (rev-002) approved with D-8 (Variant A credit card newline normalization) and D-9 (tightened username label guard)." }\n  ],\n  "pending_admin_review": []\n}\n```\n\n**Note on count:** the pinned set contains **15 classifiers** (13 from baseline rev-001 + 2 added in rev-002; 3 modified). `pending_admin_review` is empty — no unapproved deltas exist. Cite revision `rev-002` / version `1.1.0` when referencing this content.\n\n```json\n{\n  "Name": "Governed Master Data Classifiers Ruleset Store",\n  "Inquiry": "Provide the active pinned ruleset (revision rev-002 / version 1.1.0) including PII/PHI categories, regex patterns, named-entity types, and confidence thresholds, in strict read-only mode.",\n  "Mode": "Fulfill",\n  "Response": "Read master_data_classifiers/ruleset.json in strict read-only mode (no mutation). Active revision rev-002, ruleset_version 1.1.0, status PINNED, approved by Human Admin ADMIN-ROOT-001 at 2026-10-19T13:10:00Z, integrity_hash sha256-rev2-master-data-classifiers-pinned. PII subcategories: PERSON_NAME; IDENTIFIER (SSN, NATIONAL_ID, PASSPORT, DRIVERS_LICENSE, USERNAME); CONTACT (EMAIL, PHONE_NUMBER); LOCATION (STREET_ADDRESS, IP_ADDRESS); FINANCIAL (CREDIT_CARD, BANK_ACCOUNT, IBAN, CVV); DEMOGRAPHIC (DATE_OF_BIRTH). PHI subcategories: MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER (PATIENT_ID, MEDICAL_CASE_REF, HEALTH_INSURANCE_MEMBER_ID); HEALTH_DATA (ALLERGY, CONDITION, PRESCRIPTION, CLINICAL_NOTE). 15 pinned classifiers with types/patterns/thresholds: CLS-PII-SSN-001 regex 0.95; CLS-PII-CC-001 regex 0.85 (luhn_soft_fail: pass 0.99, fail 0.86); CLS-PII-EMAIL-001 regex 0.95; CLS-PII-PHONE-001 regex 0.90; CLS-PII-IP-001 regex 0.90; CLS-PII-DOB-001 regex 0.85; CLS-PII-IBAN-001 regex 0.90; CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001 regex 0.85; CLS-PII-DL-001 regex 0.85; CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001 regex 0.85; CLS-PII-NAME-001 ner entity_types [PERSON] 0.80; CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001 regex 0.90; CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 dictionary_and_heuristic (7 terms) 0.85; CLS-PII-USERNAME-001 regex_context 0.86/threshold 0.85 (D-9 Role negative lookahead); CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001 regex 0.90/threshold 0.85. Full patterns and mask strategies delivered verbatim in the response body above. pending_admin_review is empty; history shows rev-001 (1.0.0, 13 classifiers) and rev-002 (1.1.0, +2 added, 3 modified)."\n}\n```'}
