.80 | 5 | full |\n| 12 | CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001 | Medical Case Ref / Patient Member ID | PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER | regex | 0.90 | 2 | full |\n| 13 | CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 | Health Condition / Prescription / Allergy | PHI.HEALTH_DATA | dictionary + heuristic | 0.85 | 3 | full |\n| 14 | CLS-PII-USERNAME-001 | System Account Username | PII.IDENTIFIER.USERNAME | regex_context | 0.85 (assigned confidence 0.86) | 3 | full |\n| 15 | CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001 | Health Insurance Member ID / Policy Number | PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER.HEALTH_INSURANCE_MEMBER_ID | regex | 0.85 (assigned confidence 0.90) | 2 | partial |\n\nPer-classifier patterns, NER entity types, dictionary terms, heuristic notes:\n\n- **CLS-PII-SSN-001** — pattern `\\b\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{4}\\b`; partial mask (first 5 digits masked, last 4 + hyphens preserved).\n- **CLS-PII-CC-001** — pattern `\\b(?:(?:4\\d{3}|5[1-5]\\d{2}|6011|3[47]\\d{2}|\\d{4})(?:(?:-(?:\\n|\\r\\n)?\\d{4}-(?:(?:\\n|\\r\\n)?\\d{4})-(?:\\n|\\r\\n)?\\d{4})|(?:\\s\\d{4}\\s\\d{4}\\s\\d{4})))\\b`; validator `luhn_soft_fail` (luhn_pass_confidence 0.99, luhn_fail_confidence 0.86, threshold 0.85) — soft-fail Luhn, D-8 / Variant A hyphen-newline normalization.\n- **CLS-PII-EMAIL-001** — pattern `\\b[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}\\b`; partial mask (local part masked, `@` + domain preserved).\n- **CLS-PII-PHONE-001** — pattern `(?:\\+?1[-. ]?)?(?:\\(\\d{3}\\)|\\b\\d{3})[-. ]?\\d{3}[-. ]?\\d{4}\\b`; partial mask (country code + punctuation preserved).\n- **CLS-PII-IP-001** — pattern `\\b(?:(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\.){3}(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\b|\\b(?:[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}:){7}[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}\\b`; full mask.\n- **CLS-PII-DOB-001** — pattern `\\b(?:19|20)\\d{2}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])\\b|\\b(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December)\\s+(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01]),\\s+(?:19|20)\\d{2}\\b`; full mask.\n- **CLS-PII-IBAN-001** — pattern `\\b[A-Z]{2}\\d{2}(?:\\s?[A-Z0-9]{4}){3,7}(?:\\s?[A-Z0-9]{1,4})?\\b` (variable-length final group); partial mask (first 4 chars + last 2–4 preserved).\n- **CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001** — pattern `\\b[A-Z]\\d{8,9}\\b`; full mask.\n- **CLS-PII-DL-001** — pattern `\\bDL-[A-Z0-9]{6,12}(?:-[A-Z]{2})?\\b`; full mask.\n- **CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001** — pattern (horizontal-whitespace-bounded, two alternatives): `\\b\\d{1,5}[ \\t]+[A-Za-z0-9., \\t]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:,?[ \\t]+(?:Suite|Ste|Apt|Unit|#)[ \\t]+[A-Za-z0-9-]+)?,[ \\t]+[A-Za-z \\t]+,[ \\t]+[A-Z]{2}[ \\t]+\\d{5}(?:-\\d{4})?\\b` OR the same street segment without city/state/ZIP suffix; partial mask (street number/name masked, city/state/ZIP preserved).\n- **CLS-PII-NAME-001** — NER, entity_types `["PERSON"]`, threshold 0.80; full mask.\n- **CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001** — pattern `\\b(?:MC|MEM|PAT|REC)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{4,15}\\b`; full mask.\n- **CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001** — dictionary/heuristic; terms: `penicillin allergy`, `allergy`, `Hypertension`, `hypertension`, `prescription adjustment`, `emergency dispensation`, `medical dispensation`; threshold 0.85; full mask.\n- **CLS-PII-USERNAME-001** — regex_context pattern `(?i:\\b(?:Account Name|Username|User Name|Login|Account):[ \\t]*)(?!Role\\b)([a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9._-]{2,30})\\b`; label-anchored, negative lookahead guard against `Role` (D-9); confidence 0.86 / threshold 0.85; full mask.\n- **CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001** — pattern `\\b(?:HI|INS|POL|GRP)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{6,16}\\b|(?i:\\bHealth Insurance (?:Number|ID|Member ID):[ \\t]*)([A-Za-z0-9-]+)\\b`; confidence 0.90 / threshold 0.85; partial mask (plan prefix + suffix code preserved).\n\nRevision context: rev-002 (`UPDATE_PINNED_REVISION`, approved 2026-10-19T13:10:00Z) added CLS-PII-USERNAME-001 and CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001 and modified CLS-PII-CC-001, CLS-PII-IBAN-001, CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001; rev-001 (version 1.0.0, 2026-10-16) was the 13-classifier baseline. Mirror copies exist at `master_data_classifiers/ruleset.yaml` and `./ruleset.json`.\n\n```json\n{\n  "Name": "Master Data Classifiers System of Record",\n  "Inquiry": "Provide the pinned Master Data Classifiers ruleset (rev-002 / version 1.1.0) in strict read-only mode: list all enabled classifiers (regex patterns, NER entity types, dictionary term lists, heuristics) and their confidence thresholds so I can apply detection to a document.",\n  "Mode": "Fulfill",\n  "Response": "Served read-only from master_data_classifiers/ruleset.json — active revision rev-002, ruleset version 1.1.0, status PINNED, integrity hash sha256-rev2-master-data-classifiers-pinned, approved by Human Admin (ADMIN-ROOT-001) 2026-10-19T13:10:00Z. All 15 classifiers are active (pending_admin_review empty). Classifiers with confidence thresholds: CLS-PII-SSN-001 regex 0.95 (partial mask); CLS-PII-CC-001 regex + luhn_soft_fail validator 0.85 (pass 0.99 / fail 0.86, D-8 Variant A newline normalization, partial mask); CLS-PII-EMAIL-001 regex 0.95 (partial); CLS-PII-PHONE-001 regex 0.90 (partial); CLS-PII-IP-001 regex IPv4/IPv6 0.90 (full); CLS-PII-DOB-001 regex 0.85 (full); CLS-PII-IBAN-001 regex 0.90 with variable-length final group (partial); CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001 regex 0.85 (full); CLS-PII-DL-001 regex 0.85 (full); CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001 regex 0.85 horizontal-whitespace-bounded (partial); CLS-PII-NAME-001 NER entity_types [PERSON] 0.80 (full); CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001 regex 0.90 (full); CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 dictionary_and_heuristic 0.85 with terms [penicillin allergy, allergy, Hypertension, hypertension, prescription adjustment, emergency dispensation, medical dispensation] (full); CLS-PII-USERNAME-001 regex_context 0.85 with assigned confidence 0.86, label-anchored with Role negative lookahead (D-9, full); CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001 regex 0.85 with assigned confidence 0.90 (partial). Full patterns and per-classifier mask strategies are enumerated in the compiled table above; mirror copies at master_data_classifiers/ruleset.yaml and .