2026-10-19 16:08:40 BST | INFO     | nsflow:_log:821 - nsflow - 2026-10-19 16:08:40 - generated/hitl_document_redaction_obfuscation_network - INFO - {'otrace': ['orchestrator_supervisor_agent', 'ingestion_pagination_agent', 'read_pdf'], 'text': 'Got result:\n{"tool_end": true, "tool_error": false, "tool_output": {"path": "/Users/snigdhasahoo/Auto_Redaction/data/Arthur_P_Transcription.pdf", "file_name": "Arthur_P_Transcription.pdf", "file_stem": "Arthur_P_Transcription", "format": "pdf", "total_pages": 1, "content": "UK CUSTOMER SUPPORT CALL TRANSCRIPT\\nRECORD ID: REC-2026-UK-08421\\nTIMESTAMP: 2026-10-19T14:30:00Z\\nAGENT ID: AGENT_UK_512\\nCUSTOMER NAME: Arthur Pendelton\\nLOCATION: London, United Kingdom\\nTranscript\\n[14:30:12] Agent 512: Thank you for calling Metro Bank UK. My name is Oliver. Could I \\nplease take your full name and your sort code and account number?\\n[14:30:35] Arthur Pendelton: Right, hello Oliver. My name is Arthur Pendelton, and my sort \\ncode is 40-22-04, account number is 89123456.\\n[14:31:02] Agent 512: Brilliant, thank you Mr. Pendelton. Just for data protection and \\nsecurity verification, could you confirm your date of birth and your full UK postcode?\\n[14:31:25] Arthur Pendelton: Certainly. I was born on the 14th of July, 1974, and my \\npostcode is SW1A 1AA.\\n[14:31:50] Agent 512: Splendid, thank you very much for verifying that, Arthur. I\'ve located \\nyour account. How can I assist you today?\\n[14:32:10] Arthur Pendelton: I\'m calling about an unauthorized direct debit taken from my \\naccount on the 15th of October for \\u00a389.50.\\n[14:32:45] Agent 512: I am terribly sorry about that trouble, Arthur. I can see the direct \\ndebit right here. I\'ll issue an immediate indemnity claim under the Direct Debit Guarantee \\nand refund the \\u00a389.50 back to your account.\\n[14:33:15] Arthur Pendelton: Excellent, thank you. Could you also update my contact mobile \\nnumber on file to +44 7700 900077?\\n[14:33:40] Agent 512: Consider it done, Arthur. I have updated your mobile number to +44 \\n7700 900077 and sent a confirmation text. Anything else I can sort out for you?\\n[14:34:02] Arthur Pendelton: No, that covers everything. Cheers for your help, Oliver.\\n[14:34:15] Agent 512: You\'re most welcome, Arthur. Have a lovely afternoon. Cheerio!", "pages": [{"page_number": 1, "text": "UK CUSTOMER SUPPORT CALL TRANSCRIPT\\nRECORD ID: REC-2026-UK-08421\\nTIMESTAMP: 2026-10-19T14:30:00Z\\nAGENT ID: AGENT_UK_512\\nCUSTOMER NAME: Arthur Pendelton\\nLOCATION: London, United Kingdom\\nTranscript\\n[14:30:12] Agent 512: Thank you for calling Metro Bank UK. My name is Oliver. Could I \\nplease take your full name and your sort code and account number?\\n[14:30:35] Arthur Pendelton: Right, hello Oliver. My name is Arthur Pendelton, and my sort \\ncode is 40-22-04, account number is 89123456.\\n[14:31:02] Agent 512: Brilliant, thank you Mr. Pendelton. Just for data protection and \\nsecurity verification, could you confirm your date of birth and your full UK postcode?\\n[14:31:25] Arthur Pendelton: Certainly. I was born on the 14th of July, 1974, and my \\npostcode is SW1A 1AA.\\n[14:31:50] Agent 512: Splendid, thank you very much for verifying that, Arthur. I\'ve located \\nyour account. How can I assist you today?\\n[14:32:10] Arthur Pendelton: I\'m calling about an unauthorized direct debit taken from my \\naccount on the 15th of October for \\u00a389.50.\\n[14:32:45] Agent 512: I am terribly sorry about that trouble, Arthur. I can see the direct \\ndebit right here. I\'ll issue an immediate indemnity claim under the Direct Debit Guarantee \\nand refund the \\u00a389.50 back to your account.\\n[14:33:15] Arthur Pendelton: Excellent, thank you. Could you also update my contact mobile \\nnumber on file to +44 7700 900077?\\n[14:33:40] Agent 512: Consider it done, Arthur. I have updated your mobile number to +44 \\n7700 900077 and sent a confirmation text. Anything else I can sort out for you?\\