 | PII.IDENTIFIER.SSN | regex | 0.95 / 1 | partial `[SSN]` |\n| 2 | CLS-PII-CC-001 | Credit Card Number | PII.FINANCIAL.CREDIT_CARD | regex + luhn_soft_fail | 0.85 / 1 | partial `[CREDIT_CARD]` |\n| 3 | CLS-PII-EMAIL-001 | Email Address | PII.CONTACT.EMAIL | regex | 0.95 / 2 | partial `[EMAIL]` |\n| 4 | CLS-PII-PHONE-001 | Telephone Number (NANP) | PII.CONTACT.PHONE_NUMBER | regex | 0.90 / 2 | partial `[PHONE_NUMBER]` |\n| 5 | CLS-PII-IP-001 | IP Address (IPv4 & IPv6) | PII.LOCATION.IP_ADDRESS | regex | 0.90 / 3 | full `[IP_ADDRESS]` |\n| 6 | CLS-PII-DOB-001 | Date of Birth | PII.DEMOGRAPHIC.DATE_OF_BIRTH | regex | 0.85 / 3 | full `[DATE_OF_BIRTH]` |\n| 7 | CLS-PII-IBAN-001 | Bank Account (IBAN) | PII.FINANCIAL.IBAN | regex | 0.90 / 2 | partial `[IBAN]` |\n| 8 | CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001 | Passport Number | PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT | regex | 0.85 / 3 | full `[PASSPORT]` |\n| 9 | CLS-PII-DL-001 | Driver\'s License | PII.IDENTIFIER.DRIVERS_LICENSE | regex | 0.85 / 3 | full `[DRIVERS_LICENSE]` |\n| 10 | CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001 | Residential / Work Street Address | PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS | regex | 0.85 / 4 | partial `[STREET_ADDRESS]` |\n| 11 | CLS-PII-NAME-001 | Full Name / Individual Name | PII.PERSON_NAME | **ner** (PERSON) | 0.80 / 5 | full `[NAME]` |\n| 12 | CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001 | Medical Case Ref / Patient Member ID | PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER | regex | 0.90 / 2 | full `[MEDICAL_ID]` |\n| 13 | CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 | Health Condition / Prescription / Allergy | PHI.HEALTH_DATA | **dictionary_and_heuristic** | 0.85 / 3 | full `[HEALTH_DATA]` |\n| 14 | CLS-PII-USERNAME-001 | System Account Username | PII.IDENTIFIER.USERNAME | **regex_context** | 0.85 (conf 0.86) / 3 | full `[USERNAME]` |\n| 15 | CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001 | Health Insurance Member ID / Policy Number | PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER.HEALTH_INSURANCE_MEMBER_ID | regex | 0.85 (conf 0.90) / 2 | partial `[INSURANCE_ID]` |\n| 16 | CLS-UK-SORT-CODE-001 | UK Bank Sort Code | PII.FINANCIAL.UK_SORT_CODE | regex | 0.85 / 2 | partial `[SORT_CODE]` |\n| 17 | CLS-EXT-BANK-ACCT-001 | Bank Account Number | PII.FINANCIAL.BANK_ACCOUNT_NUMBER | regex | 0.85 / 2 | partial `[BANK_ACCOUNT]` |\n| 18 | CLS-EXT-UK-SPOKEN-DOB-001 | Date of Birth (Spoken & UK Format) | PII.DEMOGRAPHIC.DATE_OF_BIRTH | regex | 0.85 / 3 | full `[DATE_OF_BIRTH]` |\n| 19 | CLS-UK-POSTCODE-001 | UK Postal Code | PII.LOCATION.UK_POSTCODE | regex | 0.85 / 3 | partial `[POSTCODE]` |\n| 20 | CLS-UK-PHONE-001 | Telephone Number (UK & +44) | PII.CONTACT.PHONE_NUMBER | regex | 0.85 / 2 | partial `[PHONE_NUMBER]` |\n| 21 | CLS-UK-NINO-001 | UK National Insurance Number | PII.IDENTIFIER.UK_NINO | regex | 0.85 / 2 | partial `[NINO]` |\n| 22 | CLS-UK-NHS-NUM-001 | UK NHS Number | PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER.UK_NHS_NUMBER | regex | 0.85 / 2 | partial `[NHS_NUMBER]` |\n| 23 | CLS-EXT-EMPLOYEE-ID-001 | Employee / Agent Identifier | PII.IDENTIFIER.EMPLOYEE_ID | regex | 0.85 / 4 | full `[EMPLOYEE_ID]` |\n| 24 | CLS-EXT-AGENT-NAME-001 | Agent / Speaker Name | PII.PERSON_NAME | regex | 0.85 / 4 | full `[NAME]` |\n| 25 | CLS-EXT-TITLED-NAME-001 | Honorific Titled Surname | PII.PERSON_NAME | regex | 0.85 / 4 | full `[NAME]` |\n| 26 | CLS-UK-DRIVING-LICENCE-001 | UK Driving Licence | PII.IDENTIFIER.UK_DRIVING_LICENCE | regex | 0.85 / 3 | partial `[DRIVING_LICENCE]` |\n| 27 | CLS-UK-VEHICLE-PLATE-001 | UK Vehicle Registration Plate | PII.IDENTIFIER.UK_VEHICLE_PLATE | regex | 0.85 / 3 | partial `[VEHICLE_PLATE]` |\n| 28 | CLS-UK-UTR-001 | UK Unique Taxpayer Reference | PII.IDENTIFIER.UK_UTR | regex | 0.85 / 3 | partial `[UTR]` |\n\n(Table counts 28 rows; the change log records 13 classifiers added in rev-003, with 15 pre-existing from earlier revisions — total entries in `classifiers` array is 28.)\n\n### Patterns (verbatim, as stored)\n1. **SSN**: `\\b\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{4}\\b`\n2. **Credit Card**: `\\b(?:(?:4\\d{3}|5[1-5]\\d{2}|6011|3[47]\\d{2}|\\d{4})(?:(?:-(?:\\n|\\r\\n)?\\d{4}-(?:(?:\\n|\\r\\n)?\\d{4})-(?:\\n|\\r\\n)?\\d{4})|(?:\\s\\d{4}\\s\\d{4}\\s\\d{4})))\\b` — validator `luhn_soft_fail`: luhn_pass_confidence 0.99, luhn_fail_confidence 0.86, threshold 0.85\n3. **Email**: `\\b[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}\\b`\n4. **Phone (NANP)**: `(?:\\+?1[-. ]?)?(?:\\(\\d{3}\\)|\\b\\d{3})[-. ]?\\d{3}[-. ]?\\d{4}\\b`\n5. **IP**: `\\b(?:(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\.){3}(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\b|\\b(?:[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}:){7}[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}\\b`\n6. **DOB**: `\\b(?:19|20)\\d{2}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])\\b|\\b(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December)\\s+(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01]),\\s+(?:19|20)\\d{2}\\b`\n7. **IBAN**: `\\b[A-Z]{2}\\d{2}(?:\\s?[A-Z0-9]{4}){3,7}(?:\\s?[A-Z0-9]{1,4})?\\b`\n8. **Passport**: `\\b[A-Z]\\d{8,9}\\b`\n9. **Driver\'s License (US)**: `\\bDL-[A-Z0-9]{6,12}(?:-[A-Z]{2})?\\b`\n10. **Street Address**: `\\b\\d{1,5}[ \\t]+[A-Za-z0-9., \\t]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:,?[ \\t]+(?:Suite|Ste|Apt|Unit|#)[ \\t]+[A-Za-z0-9-]+)?,[ \\t]+[A-Za-z \\t]+,[ \\t]+[A-Z]{2}[ \\t]+\\d{5}(?:-\\d{4})?\\b|\\b\\d{1,5}[ \\t]+[A-Za-z0-9., \\t]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:,?[ \\t]+(?:Suite|Ste|Apt|Unit|#)[ \\t]+[A-Za-z0-9-]+)?\\b`\n11. **Name (NER)**: entity_types `["PERSON"]`\n12. **Medical ID**: `\\b(?:MC|MEM|PAT|REC)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{4,15}\\b`\n13. **Health Condition** — type `dictionary_and_heuristic`, terms: `penicillin allergy`, `allergy`, `Hypertension`, `hypertension`, `prescription adjustment`, `emergency dispensation`, `medical dispensation`\n14. **Username** (regex_context): `(?i:\\b(?:Account Name|Username|User Name|Login|Account):[ \\t]*)(?!Role\\b)([a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9._-]{2,30})\\b`\n15. **Insurance Member ID**: `\\b(?:HI|INS|POL|GRP)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{6,16}\\b|(?i:\\bHealth Insurance (?:Number|ID|Member ID):[ \\t]*)([A-Za-z0-9-]+)\\b`\n16. **UK Sort Code**: `(?i:\\b(?:Sort[\\s\\n_-]*Code|Sort-Code|SC|Sortcode)\\b(?:\\s+(?:is|was|:|=|#|-))?\\s*[:#=]?\\s*)([0-9]{2}[-\\s]?[0-9]{2}[-\\s]?[0-9]{2})\\b`\n17. **Bank Account Number**: `(?i:\\b(?:Account[\\s\\n_-]*(?:Number|No|#)|Acct[\\s\\n_-]*(?:Number|No|#)|Bank[\\s\\n_-]*Acct|Direct Deposit Account)\\b(?:\\s+(?:is|was|:|=|#|-))?\\s*[:#=]?\\s*)([0-9]{8,17})\\b`\n18. **Spoken/UK DOB**: `(?i:\\b(?:born(?:\\s+on)?(?:\\s+the)?|DOB|Date of Birth)\\s*[:=]?\\s*)(?:the\\s+)?(\\d{1,2}(?:st|nd|rd|th)?\\s+(?:of\\s+)?(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December)[,\\s]+\\d{4})\\b|\\b(?i:(?:born(?:\\s+on)?|DOB|Date of Birth)\\s*[:=]?\\s*)(\\d{1,2}[/-]\\d{1,2}[/-]\\d{4})\\b`\n19. **UK Postcode**: `\\b(?:GIR\\s*0AA|[A-PR-UWYZ][A-HK-Y]?\\d[A-Z\\d]?\\s*\\d[A-DEFGHJLNPQRSTUWXYZ]{2})\\b`\n20. **UK Phone**: `(?:(?:\\+44\\s*(?:\\(0\\)\\s*)?|0044\\s*)|\\b0)(?:1\\d{1,4}|2\\d|3\\d{2}|7\\d{3}|8\\d{2,3}|9\\d{2,3})\\s*\\d{3,4}\\s*\\d{3,4}\\b`\n21. **UK NINO**: `(?i:\\b(?:NINO|National Insurance(?:\\s*(?:Number|No))?|NI\\s*No|NI\\s*Number)\\s*[:#=]?\\s*)([A-Za-z]{2}\\s*\\d{2}\\s*\\d{2}\\s*\\d{2}\\s*[A-Da-d]?)\\b|\\b(?:[A-CEGHJ-PR-TW-Z][A-CEGHJ-NPR-TW-Z]|QQ)\\s*\\d{2}\\s*\\d{2}\\s*\\d{2}\\s*[A-D]?\\b`\n22. **UK NHS Number**: `(?i:\\b(?:NHS|NHS Number|NHS No|National Health Service No)\\s*[:#=]?\\s*)(\\d{3}[\\s-]?\\d{3}[\\s-]?\\d{4})\\b|\\b\\d{3}[\\s-]\\d{3}[\\s-]\\d{4}\\b`\n23. **Employee/Agent ID**: `(?i:\\b(?:Employee|Staff|Worker|Badge|Agent)[- ]*(?:ID|No|Number|#|Code)\\s*[:=]\\s*)([A-Za-z0-9_-]+)\\b|\\bAGENT_[A-Za-z0-9_-]+\\b|\\bEMP-[A-Za-z0-9-]+\\b`\n24. **Agent/Speaker Name**: `(?i:\\b(?:My name is|I am|I\'m|This is)\\s+)([A-Z][a-zA-Z]+(?: [A-Z][a-zA-Z]+)?)\\b`\n25. **Titled Surname**: `\\b(?:Mr\\.?|Mrs\\.?|Ms\\.?|Miss|Dr\\.?|Prof\\.?)\\s+([A-Z][a-zA-Z]+)\\b`\n26. **UK Driving Licence**: `(?i:\\b(?:Driving Licen[cs]e|Driver Licen[cs]e|DL)\\s*[:#=]?\\s*)([A-Z]{5}\\s*\\d{6}\\s*[A-Z]{2}\\d[A-Z]{2})\\b`\n27. **UK Vehicle Plate**: `(?i:\\b(?:Registration|Reg Plate|Vehicle Reg|VRM|Number Plate|Reg No|Reg Number)\\s*[:#=]?\\s*)([A-Z]{2}\\d{2}\\s?[A-Z]{3})\\b`\n28. **UK UTR**: `(?i:\\b(?:UTR|Unique Taxpayer Reference|Tax Reference)\\s*[:#=]?\\s*)(\\d{5}\\s?\\d{5}|\\d{10})\\b`\n\n## Change history\n- **rev-003** (1.2.0), Human Admin / `ADMIN-ROOT-001`, `2026-10-19T15:40:00Z`, action `UPDATE_PINNED_REVISION`: 13 classifiers added, 0 removed, 0 modified — CLS-UK-SORT-CODE-001, CLS-EXT-BANK-ACCT-001, CLS-EXT-UK-SPOKEN-DOB-001, CLS-UK-POSTCODE-001, CLS-UK-PHONE-001, CLS-UK-NINO-001, CLS-UK-NHS-NUM-001, CLS-EXT-EMPLOYEE-ID-001, CLS-EXT-AGENT-NAME-001, CLS-EXT-TITLED-NAME-001, CLS-UK-DRIVING-LICENCE-001, CLS-UK-VEHICLE-PLATE-001, CLS-UK-UTR-001.\n- `pending_admin_review`: empty.\n\nConfidence-threshold range across the ruleset: 0.80 (PERSON NER name) to 0.95 (SSN, email); all others 0.85–0.90. This content was served strictly read-only; no state was mutated.\n\n```json\n{\n  "Name": "Master Data Classifiers Ruleset Registry (governed system of record)",\n  "Inquiry": "Provide the active pinned Master Data Classifiers ruleset (rev-003 / version 1.2.0): categories, regex patterns, NER types, dictionary term lists, heuristics, and confidence thresholds. Read-only access for PII/PHI detection.",\n  "Mode": "Fulfill",\n  "Response": "Served the active pinned ruleset from master_data_classifiers/ruleset.json: active_revision_id rev-003, ruleset_version 1.2.0, status PINNED, approved by Human Admin (ADMIN-ROOT-001) at 2026-10-19T15:40:00Z, integrity_hash sha256-rev3-master-data-classifiers-pinned. Contains 2 top-level categories (PII with PERSON_NAME, IDENTIFIER, CONTACT, LOCATION, FINANCIAL, DEMOGRAPHIC; PHI with MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER, HEALTH_DATA) and 28 classifier definitions: 24 regex, 1 regex_context (CLS-PII-USERNAME-001), 1 NER (CLS-PII-NAME-001, entity_types [PERSON], threshold 0.80), 1 dictionary_and_heuristic (CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 with 7 terms: penicillin allergy, allergy, Hypertension, hypertension, prescription adjustment, emergency dispensation, medical dispensation; threshold 0.85). Credit card classifier uses luhn_soft_fail validator (pass 0.99 / fail 0.86 / threshold 0.85). Confidence thresholds range 0.80-0.95. Change history: rev-003 added 13 UK/conversational classifiers, 0 removed, 0 modified; pending_admin_review empty. Read was read-only; no state mutated."\n}\n```'}
