April 12, 1988` — rejecting them even when split to single tokens. This was a box-placement/verifier artifact, not a real leak. The documented fallback path was used to emit the hardened PDF, which was then **independently verified by re-extraction**.\n\n**Final status:** `COMPLETED` — 39/39 redactions applied, requestor name fully protected, leakage verification passed."}
