ve pulled up your record. I see the charge made on 2026-10-10 using your visa card 4532-8910-4321-9081.\n[09:16:40] Sarah Jenkins: Right, that wasn’t me. Please send the refund confirmation to s.jenkins88@example-mail.com or text me at 555-382-9102.\n[09:17:10] Agent 4092: I have initiated the chargeback to your account at US39 OBAK 0123 4567 8901 23. You will receive a confirmation email shortly.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRECORD ID: REC-2026-08913\nTIMESTAMP: 2026-10-14T11:02:15Z\nAGENT ID: AGENT_1022\n[CUSTOMER PROFILE]\nFull Name: Dr. Marcus Aurelius Vance\nDate of Birth: 1975-11-30\nPassport Number: N89201492\nDriver’s License ID: DL-8830192-OR\nPrimary Phone: +1 (555) 712-4091\nEmail Address: m.vance@vanceresearch-labs.org\nWork Address: 100 Cyberdyne Way, Suite 400, Portland, OR 97201\n[INTERNAL NOTES & HEALTH INFORMATION]\nMedical Case Ref: MC-9021-X\nPatient/Member ID: MEM-309182\nNotes: Customer requested emergency dispensation update. Dr. Vance noted a history of penicillin allergy and recent prescription adjustment for Hypertension. Emergency contact is Elena Vance (Spouse) reachable at 555-712-4099.\n================================================================================\nEND OF TEST DATA FILE\n================================================================================\n```\n\n⚠️ **Note on filename:** This file's name itself contains PII — `Sarah_1988-04-12.pdf` embeds a **first name (\"Sarah\")** and a **date of birth (\"1988-04-12\")**. Filename redaction will be handled per the DSAR policy below (the name portion may be preserved if it's the requestor's own; the DOB will be redacted).\n\n**Status:** `WAITING_FOR_REQUESTOR`\n\n**Who is the DSAR Requestor (Data Subject) for this assessment?**\n\nPerson names found in this document to help you answer:\n- **Sarah Elizabeth Jenkins** — Customer/Subject in Record REC-2026-08912\n- **Dr. Marcus Aurelius Vance** — Customer/Subject in Recor